ers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/steven-pribilinskiy","id":3078595,"login":"steven-pribilinskiy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/commits/13bf6c195e9c4d3b15138ac767c3cccb18402806/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T13:41:50Z","email":"steven.pribilinskiy@gmail.com","name":"Steven Pribilinskiy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T13:41:50Z","email":"steven.pribilinskiy@gmail.com","name":"Steven Pribilinskiy"},"message":"chore: move off deprecated biome rule field and stale Anthropic defaults\n\nbiome 2.5.6 deprecates linter.rules.recommended in favour of a preset. Note\n`biome migrate` rewrites it to `preset: \"none\"`, which disables every rule -\nverified against a probe file - so this sets `preset: \"recommended\"` to keep\nthe rule set the config has always had.\n\nThe enrich provider defaulted to a superseded Opus model, sent no thinking\nconfiguration (on the current model that runs adaptively and shares the\nmax_tokens budget with the response), had no request timeout while the other\ntwo providers did, and reported a policy refusal as unparseable output.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0