bilinskiy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/commits/850b370e9bdad2a3f708e4ab6edcb27b1ae8408b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:04:44Z","email":"steven.pribilinskiy@gmail.com","name":"Steven Pribilinskiy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T11:04:44Z","email":"steven.pribilinskiy@gmail.com","name":"Steven Pribilinskiy"},"message":"feat(ui): convey each project''s storage location\n\nSurface where a project''s tickets actually live. /api/projects now\nreturns each project''s id + full location (kind, scope, dataDir, remote,\nbranch, pushEnabled) plus a top-level storeRoots summary; aggregated\ntickets carry projectId and ?project= accepts an id or a name.\n\nWeb: project chips get a location tooltip and a ⌂ glyph for central\nstores, and a provenance strip shows the selected project''s store (or\nthe store roots on the all-projects view). TUI: the selected ticket''s\nstore location renders under the header. TicketsMeta/ProjectMeta and the\nLit re-exports carry the richer shape.\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019pnwcwFWbkAoEs6A1CDAGu","tree":{"sha":"98e45ca7a1a97751bf1103edce9543e5247d6b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/git/trees/98e45ca7a1a97751bf1103edce9543e5247d6b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/git/commits/850b370e9bdad2a3f708e4ab6edcb27b1ae8408b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https: