even Pribilinskiy"},"message":"feat(ui): full-width docked split; archived switch only when relevant, with a count badge\n\n- ay-ticket-list emits ay-dock-change {docked, split} so host pages can drop\n  their container width cap while the split is active (central shell included)\n- tickets fetch once with archived included; the switch filters client-side,\n  renders only when archived tickets exist, and carries their count\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c723abf4c2e8e55a4220439152dbbd297a2a14d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/git/trees/c723abf4c2e8e55a4220439152dbbd297a2a14d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/git/commits/2f47217dd6fe37d85ffd88e57d15b688fd41afa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3078595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/steven-pribilinskiy","id":3078595,"login":"steven-pribilinskiy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aylith-labs/tickets/comm