,"message":"feat(ui): docked detail is a real split pane with a resizable splitter\n\nDocking no longer overlays — the detail takes space beside the list/board\nwith a col-resize splitter between the panes; the pane width and dock mode\npersist to localStorage. ay-ticket-detail becomes a controlled component\n(docked property + ay-dock-toggle event); the toolbar wraps in narrow panes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15abadda6e17a632324d1ea4ae0925b25691e1a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/git/trees/15abadda6e17a632324d1ea4ae0925b25691e1a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aylith-labs/tickets/git/commits/e33aaa4c423960bdb98085bc3aace04c011d2ee6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3078595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/steven-pribilinskiy","id":3078595,"login":"steven-pribilinskiy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1OTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/steven-pribilinskiy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aylith-labs/tickets/commit/e33aaa4c423960bdb98085bc3aace04c011d2