 xblocks under containers imported from library.\n* Improves drag-n-drop by creating a representational drag overlay.","tree":{"sha":"9e7769df9770981a4850fc13c862ef07d70fc972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raniwakhare-sko/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/9e7769df9770981a4850fc13c862ef07d70fc972"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/raniwakhare-sko/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/915bd559e05eea6438ef94b646dc45df54e5c5da","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e7769df9770981a4850fc13c862ef07d70fc972\nparent 00ce3d78568375c42804932bc6c84c43ec8dbd55\nauthor Navin Karkera <navin@opencraft.com> 1754325999 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1754325999 -0500\n\nfeat: disable drag handles for children of library imported containers in course outline [FC-0097] (#2311)\n\n* Hides/disables drag handles for children components of containers imported from library.\n* Disables move, delete and duplicate options for children components.\n* Move up and down option skips containers that cannot accept children (imported from library).\n* Authors cannot drag and drop xblocks under containers imported from library.\n* Improves drag-n-drop by creating a representational drag overlay. ","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJokOPvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9VgQAAbPbiY76pjXfF0KQ4rSYLIJ\naf4PB5kSgVE7TloE3vEFehDzczRcL7JMniUbknx8b0l54tKMCP/DZxSI7ZTn/Gwc\n2U1+qXZfhuGECXY5OYBBgvUUyycl4g39nGncieb56+WHa5waw7IaK2yhmHHdqMSQ\nT0XmZC3RVkT3axNaRYGNMevcx30hCiEjQCZQ2l4gblsOCYBqEZW+TyJnGhc1isoN\nGYcLzHfot++Jxd1CiyEk4TFRaN2rOmts1oyqp7XUb0Gv9ciLceQn0kvQb75+wO1u\naDOm/j3BEED83/SsOCW/HnkogSXXBYpU5rrIWrdFJirwb8FD++OzmI955eIL4grl\nm/DbXWvjBaGw513OZH/HkmKEWGg3xM/Xpjr5bWolTNXaSoJ/RTBYoCh7li7CxuCv\n0p6RkhqxG0iEltQxYPeZTn0SBkQ7AFTFF1RV/G0njqRBB6Ja6B2g/geTxZpORs+q\nnnCHiqWIQ5Jhf2X716CShRhoj69USvinQrGhxbNyt8ZmsSjRfggd9WrvHV0FGPFs\nlFOsajBD7BWovxNB3t66qNKqlJ/gisQAjgCg6g8lUTfeuZ+wdrBA4Vmu/RCObKzF\nHiQ3ziKyc+jP+R3r63OrFDHws/llagOsSb2qllFZwr+d8xXE5pp7Gp0OO/jnvYVb\nS3pnk0VArswrV79