owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-loom-plugin/commits/299f8ab0f0f9651242655c39112a0a411c1f717e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:03:35Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:03:35Z","email":"danielrosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"message":"chore(deps): upgrade Module Federation to 1.19.1\n\nMatches the Sero host, which moved @module-federation/vite 1.11.0 → 1.19.1.\nThe two lines share React through different mechanisms, so a plugin built\nagainst the old one resolves a null React and crashes on its first hook.\n\nAlso declares sero.plugin.runtimeAbi: 2 — the host refuses to mount a UI whose\nABI does not match, showing a reinstall prompt instead of crashing. The version\nis pinned exactly: a caret range resolves to a newer line on a fresh install\nand silently breaks React sharing.","tree":{"sha":"17baa30a9836a14e50b445ce62b305f2ce87042a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-loom-plugin/git/trees/17baa30a9836a14e50b445ce62b305f2ce87042a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-loom-plugin/git/commits/299f8ab0f0f9651242655c39112a0a411c1f717e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"htt