wing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/d2d2e2119fd9dfeab3e834252a2c0719a9a5ce59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T12:50:41Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T13:25:20Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"message":"feat: add employees-vs-billing scatter and filing seasonality chart to network view\n\nAdds GET /network/efficiency: employee count + annual billing per\nadvisory, rendered as a scatter (efficiency-scatter.tsx) with a\nregression line and Pearson r badge — points above the line are\noutperforming what their headcount predicts. Extracts the regression\nmath (linearRegression/pearson/regressionLine) out of\ncorrelation-grid.tsx into lib/regression.ts so both components share\nit instead of duplicating.\n\nAdds filings-seasonality-chart.tsx, reusing the monthly filing counts\nalready returned by GET /network/metrics (no new endpoint needed) to\nshow income/VAT/corporate/other filings per month, with a shaded\nReferenceArea marking the abr-jun tax season spike.\n\nBoth charts render side by side in a 2-column grid on the network\npage, motivated by seasonality and advisory-size-proportionality\npatterns found while auditing the seed data.","tree":{"sha":"632eea58d852cca7b98218794400a4b018dfb075","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/trees/632eea58d852cca7b98218794400a4b018dfb075"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/commits/d2d2e2119fd9dfeab3e834252a2c0719a9a5ce59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177054994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS/Pulse/commit/d2d2e2119fd9dfeab3e834252a2c0719a9a5ce59","node_id":"C_kwDOTTj8VNoAKGQyZDJlMjExOWZkOWRmZWFiM2U4MzQyNTJhMmMwNzE5YTlhNWNlNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS/Pulse/commit/cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852","sha":"cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852"}],"sha":"d2d2e2119fd9dfeab3e834252a2c0719a9a5ce59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/d2d2e2119fd9dfeab3e834252a2c0719a9a5ce59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177054994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:47:56Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:47:56Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"message":"feat: add revenue concentration chart to network view\n\nAdds GET /network/revenue-concentration: sums total annual billing per\nadvisory (all 12 months, same window as the existing \"Facturación\ntotal anual\" KPI) and computes what share the top 5 advisories\nrepresent of the network total.\n\nRenders it as a donut chart (top 5 vs. rest) with the percentage\ncentered and colored by risk threshold (>=40% high, >=25% moderate,\nelse diversified — matching the concentration-risk framing from the\noriginal proposal), plus a ranked table of the top 5 advisories with\ntheir billing and individual share, linking to each advisory''s detail\npage.\n\nThis completes all 5 originally proposed network-view charts: early\nwarning, derived metrics, positioning matrix, specialty benchmarkin\nand revenue concentration.","tree":{"sha":"ee3cb172aa6c4f13fcbbc486e600978abc1771c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/trees/ee3cb172aa6c4f13fcbbc486e600978abc1771c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/commits/cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177054994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS/Pulse/commit/cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852","node_id":"C_kwDOTTj8VNoAKGNmNTBmNGE2OTgwNzMzODg0YzZmYmU4NTcyZGMzNjc0OTE5YjA4NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS/Pulse/commit/ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f","sha":"ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f"}],"sha":"cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/cf50f4a6980733884c6fbe8572dc3674919b0852"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177054994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:34:25Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:34:25Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"message":"feat: add specialty benchmarking radar chart to network view\n\nAdds GET /network/benchmark: aggregates 5 metrics per advisory over\nthe last 6 months (revenue/employee, satisfaction, net growth rate,\nquery resolution rate, AEAT incident rate), then averages the\nper-advisory ratios by specialty in NetworkService — averaging ratios\nrather than summing raw totals so larger advisories don''t skew the\ncomparison between specialties.\n\nRenders it as a Recharts radar chart with one line per specialty. Each\naxis is min-max normalized across the 3 specialties (mixing €, %, and\n/10 scales on a shared radial axis otherwise wouldn''t be readable),\nwith the incident-rate axis inverted so \"further out\" consistently\nmeans \"better\" on all 5 axes. Tooltip shows the real formatted value,\nnot the normalized score.\n\nExtracts SPECIALTY_COLOR into lib/specialty-colors.ts, now shared\nbetween positioning-matrix and benchmark-radar instead of duplicated.","tree":{"sha":"c51e6e8813ceebe5037272131ea94b2172a799d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/trees/c51e6e8813ceebe5037272131ea94b2172a799d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/commits/ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177054994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS/Pulse/commit/ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f","node_id":"C_kwDOTTj8VNoAKGNlZDRlM2ZiODBiYjc0OGZiMTdiYzBlYWJjMzgxY2Q1NWNkMWM2M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS/Pulse/commit/f31da6aca7e4ce9450abc56cc881a54e223cda80","sha":"f31da6aca7e4ce9450abc56cc881a54e223cda80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/f31da6aca7e4ce9450abc56cc881a54e223cda80"}],"sha":"ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/ced4e3fb80bb748fb17bc0eabc381cd55cd1c63f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177054994?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/f31da6aca7e4ce9450abc56cc881a54e223cda80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:00:04Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:00:04Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"message":"feat: add positioning matrix to network view (growth vs. satisfaction)\n\nAdds GET /network/positioning: aggregates net client growth\n(altas-bajas) and average satisfaction per advisory over the last 6\nmonths via a grouped SQL query in MetricsRepository, alongside total\nbilling for bubble sizing.\n\nRenders it as a Recharts scatter plot on the network page — one series\nper specialty (color), bubble size = billing, reference lines at\nx=0 and mean satisfaction to mark the 4 quadrants (star / hidden gem /\nat risk / growing with problems), axis domains sized to the actual\ndata range instead of fixed bounds, and click-through to the advisory\ndetail page per point.","tree":{"sha":"d4db3a8e9f8432834e07bb3fca7e41084a3419f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/N