,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nico-RS","id":177054994,"login":"Nico-RS","node_id":"U_kgDOCo2lEg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nico-RS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/commits/7a1f6eb147faf48f23cd418f811ebb9da3c7314f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:40:01Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:40:01Z","email":"nicors.ts@gmail.com","name":"Nicolas Rodriguez"},"message":"feat: add derived metrics to advisory detail (revenue/employee, churn, incident and resolution rates, hours/client)\n\nComputes 6 metrics not present in the seed (revenue per employee/client,\nmonthly churn rate, AEAT incident rate, query resolution rate, hours\nper client) from the existing monthly series, exposed via the current\n/advisories/:id/metrics response with no new queries.\n\nShows them as a card grid with sparklines on the advisory detail\nscreen. DeltaBadge gains an `invert` option so an increase in churn,\nincidents or hours/client renders as a regression rather than a gain,\nand its null-state label is clarified to \"Tendencia no disponible\"\nsince the current value can exist even when the 6-month trend can''t\nbe computed (e.g. dividing by a reference month that was 0%).","tree":{"sha":"82755454f051755e8df900c7bc339dd8f13afd3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nico-RS/Pulse/git/trees/82755454f0517