,"name":"SiberianHusky"},"message":"feat: mcpanel 0.20.2——实例附加端口开放/回收、终端手机端内滚布局、时长注入匹配错位修复\n\n- 0.20.0：实例设置页新增「端口管理」——附加 tcp/udp 端口一键开放（节点端口池自动分配或手动指定）与回收，开放前探测节点宿主机端口占用（port.check），主端口不可变；开放/回收后节点自动按新端口重建容器\n- 0.20.0：实例编辑弹窗保存整档保留表单外字段（端口/环境变量/config/域名/P2P），修复静默清空；设置页保存路径对端口做一致性校验\n- 0.20.1：终端页手机端固定高度内滚布局，侧栏默认收起；文件列表占满侧栏剩余空间，消除溢出滚动条\n- 0.20.2：时长注入匹配修复——插件形态实例只匹配未声明加载器的制品；注入卡片展示形态/加载器/MC 版本区间","tree":{"sha":"daff8124011d238bdb1ded0fe3e1e0504d4de491","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/yudream-admin-plugins/git/trees/daff8124011d238bdb1ded0fe3e1e0504d4de491"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/yudream-admin-plugins/git/commits/53c90264a915f7b66761cd33a049a03da63690d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72290399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YDHusky","id":72290399,"login":"YDHusky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMzk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/yudream-admin-plugins/commit/53c90264a915f7b66761cd33a049a03da63690d1","node_id":"C_kwDOTTpCzdoAKDUzYzkwMjY0YTkxNWY3YjY2NzYxY2QzM2EwNDlhMDNkYTYzNjkwZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/yudream-admin-pl