搜索/刷新），消费 /api/plugins/forum/** 公开接口\n- yudream-skin 移动页：我的资料 + 我的角色，消费 /api/plugins/yudream-skin/me/**；\n  皮肤库/衣柜移动版留待后续迭代\n- @yudream/plugin-sdk-mobile 为宿主仓契约副本（纯类型，待契约包发布后切 catalog）\n- 两插件 pom 增加 frontend-mobile/{code} resource 打包；plugin.yml 声明 mobile:\n  （platforms 双端 / minHostVersion 0.1.0）\n- 构建注意：独立 rspack CLI 构建 MF remote 需 RepackPlugin 显式传 platform/output；\n  getResolveOptions(platform) 的平台扩展名不可被自定义 extensions 覆盖；\n  MF 容器名必须是合法 JS 标识符（连字符 code 需转下划线）\n- 本地实测：两包 rspack 构建成功、tsc 零错误","tree":{"sha":"0cd1a791ea3b758706de41072db70c44843f5b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/yudream-admin-plugins/git/trees/0cd1a791ea3b758706de41072db70c44843f5b04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mcyudream/yudream-admin-plugins/git/commits/9ee38b2c02a02e3add649081664f6c1c6e8a405d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72290399?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YDHusky","id":72290399,"login":"YDHusky","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMzk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YDHusky","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mcyudream/yudream-admin-plugins/commit/9ee38b2c02a02e3add649081664f6c1c6e8a405d","node_id":"C_kwDOTTpCzdoAKDllZTM4YjJjMDJhMDJlM2FkZD