users/JeffreySanford/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/commits/9c722a6c580578ec8aa082d555b6b720da186dce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:44:29Z","email":"jeffreysanford@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T18:44:29Z","email":"jeffreysanford@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey"},"message":"Update CHANGELOG for work since 1.0.0; reconcile doc 11 against reality\n\nAdd an Unreleased section to CHANGELOG.md summarizing everything that\nlanded since the 1.0.0 entry: Zeroheight retirement, the Button\ncandidate rename and contract absorption, the Interaction Stories\nrename, the proprietary-content scrub, the generated Starlight\ncomponent-status table, real unit-test wiring, and token-boundary\nremediation.\n\nReconcile three stale checkboxes in 11-prioritized-backlog.md against\nverified reality: real contract tests now exist (92 passing tests via\nvitest across ui-patterns and qa-remote, confirmed by actually running\nthem, not just checking config), token-boundary remediation is\npartially done, and obsolete environment variables have been removed.\n\nRemove AGILE_API_URL, PERFORMANCE_API_URL, and DATABASE_URL from\n.env.sample/.env.example: leftovers from the retired backend with zero\ncode references anywhere in the repo. SCREENSHOT_BASE_URL and\nA11Y_BASE_URL remain since both are genuinely used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84dc0277a27bb66a4d4bbdb7b9b32d6014348fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/trees/84dc0277a27bb66a4d4