 actual doc 18-20 and manifest state\n\nThe four grok-tasks checklists (STEP18/19/20, BROADER-GAPS) were left\nentirely or mostly unchecked even though the corresponding real work\nhappened in docs/documentation-upgrade/18-20 and this session''s\ncommits. Cross-check each item against the live manifest and the\nnumbered docs and update accordingly, so the checklists reflect what\nhas actually been verified rather than looking untouched.\n\nAlso fixes a real stale checkbox found during the cross-check: doc 20\nsaid \"Every public entry has a documented disposition\" was open, but\nall 21 manifest entries already carry an audit.disposition value.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1115e1ee780cc2aa02111412765a7947299a7093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/trees/1115e1ee780cc2aa02111412765a7947299a7093"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/commits/36df7d73408e36f01fdb9ad5ff83fc7c14644841","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7098018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford","id":7098018,"login":"JeffreySanford","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTgwMTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h