","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford","id":7098018,"login":"JeffreySanford","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTgwMTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/commits/ac5570e897a7d5f8c1f5d6f08ede0ab1dc65afb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:02:56Z","email":"jeffreysanford@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:02:56Z","email":"jeffreysanford@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey"},"message":"Complete API extraction for Card/Tag/Toast; resolve Phase 4 selector/escape-hatch items\n\nps-card, ps-tag, ps-toast, and public-toast-service had empty\ninputs/outputs in the manifest despite having real public APIs.\nDocument their actual inputs, outputs, or service methods and public\ntypes, resolving finding API-PARTIAL-001.\n\nInvestigate the remaining Phase 4 items: selector normalization\n(public-* -> ps-*) turns out to already be complete and intentionally\ngated behind a major-version compatibility window (tracked via\nselectorAliases, finding API-NAMING-001, a dedicated migration doc,\nand a live Component Inventory UI test) rather than leftover cruft.\nThe one tracked provider escape hatch (ps-button''s styleClass) is\ngated behind the same policy as the Button API''s other deprecated\naliases. Nothing removed; doc 10 updated to record these findings\naccurately instead of leaving them as open checkboxes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"07ee2fae3e813241657f1c96053d53ef1fb0745c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/trees/07ee2fae3e813241657f1c96053d53ef1fb0745c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/commits/ac5570e897a7d5f8c1f5d6f08ede0ab1dc65afb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7098018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford","id":7098018,"login":"JeffreySanford","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTgwMTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/commit/ac5570e897a7d5f8c1f5d6f08ede0ab1dc65afb0","node_id":"C_kwDOTTrddNoAKGFjNTU3MGU4OTdhN2Q1ZjhjMWY1ZDZmMDhlZGUwYWIxZGM2NWFmYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/commit/509beb2c464cc9ef758ab6316aea22de8079e8ce","sha":"509beb2c464cc9ef758ab6316aea22de8079e8ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/commits/509beb2c464cc9ef758ab6316aea