fest, Storybook, e2e suites, tokens, and docs, so the internal\nnaming matches the public \"Button Contract Exploration\" label.\n\nRecord the long-term Button strategy in button-api-migration.md:\nretire ps-button-candidate as a documented case study rather than\nmerging it further or promoting it to a second permanent Button, since\nps-button already carries the full target contract.\n\nFix two remaining \"QA\" vocabulary leaks into public-facing copy: the\nshell''s actual navigation label and button (\"QA Components\"/\"QA route\"\n-> \"Component Lab\"/\"Component Lab route\") and matching evidence copy in\nthe Design Alignment Lab UI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"589a89471a2d30c61c03beff968bb60f88c4b98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/trees/589a89471a2d30c61c03beff968bb60f88c4b98a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/commits/893bb04cc60eac3a0c45fb9d4b71c75e24a34608","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7098018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford","id":7098018,"login":"JeffreySanford","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTgwMTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https:/