ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:05:26Z","email":"jeffreysanford@gmail.com","name":"Jeffrey"},"message":"Complete Interaction Stories rename and start Button consolidation\n\nRename the last four Storybook categories from Design System/Acceptance/*\nto Design System/Interaction Stories/* (Card, Dialog Toast, Edge Case\nStates, Table Paginator), syncing the manifest registry and every\nhardcoded story-ID reference in e2e specs and the Storybook smoke script.\nAlso fixes two dead waitForStory() guards in storybook-e2e.mjs left\nstale by earlier renames, which could let axe run before Angular\nfinished bootstrapping under load.\n\nBegin the approved ps-up-button -> ps-button consolidation by absorbing\nthe one missing piece of the target contract: a governed iconName\nidentifier, added alongside the existing deprecated PrimeIcons icon\nstring following the same additive-deprecation pattern as tone/intent.\nps-up-button itself is not removed yet; that requires inventorying its\nremaining Experiments/case-study evidence first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad24f02dbab11025b159b20b3bc737ee2c353197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/trees/ad24f02dbab11025b159b20b3bc737ee2c353197"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JeffreySanford/public-sector-federation/git/commits/2fc2534d76ade8e99ff3dc9cc15c4b307e2bfd6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7098018?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JeffreySanford/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreySanford","id":7098018,"