wparrado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado","id":32748361,"login":"wparrado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzQ4MzYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/c10062ac3a73f2b0610fc7fe32654eeb6af39567/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:56:22Z","email":"waltherstein@hotmail.com","name":"Walther Parrado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:56:22Z","email":"waltherstein@hotmail.com","name":"Walther Parrado"},"message":"Fix devcontainer: docker-in-docker con moby:false (base trixie)\n\nLa imagen base devcontainers/python:3.11 pasó a Debian trixie, donde los\npaquetes moby-cli no existen y la feature docker-in-docker fallaba al crear\nel contenedor. Se instala Docker CE (moby:false), el arreglo recomendado por\nla propia feature.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48af6ba27dfd9e420204792b4c2350c2228b992e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/git/trees/48af6ba27dfd9e420204792b4c2350c2228b992e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/git/commits/c10062ac3a73f2b0610fc7fe32654eeb6af39567","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32748361?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado","id":32748361,"login":"wparrado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzQ4MzYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commit/c10062ac3a73f2b0610fc7fe32654eeb6af39567","node_id":"C_kwDOTTuSndoAKGMxMDA2MmFjM2E3M2YyYjA2MTBmYzdmZTMyNjU0ZWViNmFmMzk1Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commit/f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8","sha":"f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8"}],"sha":"c10062ac3a73f2b0610fc7fe32654eeb6af39567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/c10062ac3a73f2b0610fc7fe32654eeb6af39567"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32748361?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado","id":32748361,"login":"wparrado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzQ4MzYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:46:32Z","email":"waltherstein@hotmail.com","name":"Walther Parrado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:46:32Z","email":"waltherstein@hotmail.com","name":"Walther Parrado"},"message":"Levantar toda la solución (back + front) con un solo comando Docker\n\nUn único `docker compose up --build` levanta monolito, catalog-service,\ngateway y frontend estático, igual en local que en Codespaces:\n\n- Dockerfile: imagen única con los 3 backends + frontends estáticos.\n- docker/start-all.sh: lanza los 4 procesos sobre localhost (mismo supuesto\n  que gateway/main.py, así ningún servicio cambia) y los apaga limpio.\n- docker-compose.yml: publica 8000/8001/9000/8080 en el host.\n- .dockerignore: contexto de build limpio.\n- devcontainer: feature docker-in-docker para que compose funcione en\n  Codespaces; retira el auto-arranque del http.server (ahora lo sirve compose,\n  evitando el conflicto en el 8080).\n- README: sección de arranque de un comando + docs de Sesión 5/6.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c1861c50dc9373b3df6340bea5f84ef035b424e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/git/trees/c1861c50dc9373b3df6340bea5f84ef035b424e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/git/commits/f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32748361?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado","id":32748361,"login":"wparrado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzQ4MzYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commit/f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8","node_id":"C_kwDOTTuSndoAKGY4ZGU5MjA1MzM2ZThhZDkyZTY5NGE2YTU2Y2IxM2JhZjg4NTUxYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commit/c8a0310e0e5bbaa782a423178da504ae5126fb48","sha":"c8a0310e0e5bbaa782a423178da504ae5126fb48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/c8a0310e0e5bbaa782a423178da504ae5126fb48"}],"sha":"f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/f8de9205336e8ad92e694a6a56cb13baf88551b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32748361?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wparrado","id":32748361,"login":"wparrado","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzQ4MzYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wparrado","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wparrado/mercaloop-estudiantes/commits/c8a0310e0e5bbaa782a423178da504ae5126fb48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:46:21Z","email":"waltherstein@hotmail.com","name":"Walther Parrado"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T12:46:21Z","email":"waltherstein@hotmail.com","name":"Walther Parrado"},"message":"Add Sesión 5/6: event bus, outbox + saga coreografiada\n\nComunicación asíncrona basada en eventos (Sesión 5) y Transactional\nOutbox + Saga Coreografiada con compensación (Sesión 6):\n\n- app/event_bus.py: pub/sub en memoria (fire-and-forget) con worker daemon.\n- app/outbox.py: tabla outbox en memoria + relay de fondo, con flag\n  BROKER_DOWN controlable en runtime.\n- orders/service.py: desacopla la notificación vía outbox.write(\"OrdenCreada\"),\n  agrega mark_requiere_revision() idempotente y register() para compensar\n  ante \"NotificacionFallida\".\n- notifications/service.py: flags SIMULATE_SLOW/SIMULATE_FAILURE,\n  handle_orden_creada() que publica \"NotificacionFallida\" al fallar, y register().\n- app/admin/: router con perillas de simulación e inspección (outbox,\n  notifications-log).\n- main.py: monta el router de admin y arranca worker/relay/registros en startup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{