(an \"Entrance\" in every adventure path).\n- REST search gains a `source` query param (comma-separated); MCP `search` tool gains a\n  `source` arg.\n- MCP browsing: new `list_summaries` tool (enumerate page/chapter/book summaries in\n  table-of-contents order — page_start-ordered, book-level first); `list_entities` gains\n  name_search / trait / level_min / level_max for exhaustive server-side filtering.\n- summaries.list_summaries now orders by page position (nulls-first) for TOC reads.\n- test_fts_search_source_filter covers exact / series-prefix / multi-book scoping.","tree":{"sha":"d08c0e81a4ade91a4d92165851a05446b85cbdc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/trees/d08c0e81a4ade91a4d92165851a05446b85cbdc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/commits/136a5ef750322e5e79d9d2515ff3ebb3b17019c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1749347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cammoraton","id":1749347,"login":"cammoraton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDkzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cammoraton/compendium/commit/136a5ef