the local ones so\ncontainer mounts work on a fresh clone.\n\n- space_presets/  -> data/presets/    (committed, shipped config)\n- book_manifests/ -> data/manifests/  (committed, shipped guided-extraction manifests)\n- data/{images,chat_logs,backups,pdfs}/ scaffolded with .gitkeep (contents local/\n  gitignored) so the ../data/images and ../data/pdfs bind-mounts exist on a fresh clone.\n- .gitignore: data/* ignored, presets + manifests re-included, .gitkeep markers kept.\n- Resolvers (_presets_dir / book_manifests_dir), Dockerfile.api COPYs, and the compose\n  PDF/IMAGES mount defaults repointed to data/ (PDF_DIR now defaults to ../data/pdfs).","tree":{"sha":"79fa011ebe16e161a8213bc33aa3f2f3cdd1ebbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/trees/79fa011ebe16e161a8213bc33aa3f2f3cdd1ebbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/commits/45029c684e752319f72f0552c881d306da91f3cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1749347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cammoraton","id":1749347,"login":"cammoraton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDkzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cammoraton/compendium/commit/45029c684e752319f72f0552c881d306da91f3cb","node_id":"C_kwDOTTydStoAKDQ1MDI5YzY4NGU3NTIzMTlmNzJmMDU1MmM4ODFkMzA2ZGE5MWYzY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cammoraton/compendium/commit/cbeb2fc964e62ec4db309157c5f831f9f4e97a2b","sha":"cbeb2fc964e62ec4db309157c5f831f9f4e97a2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/commits/cbeb2fc964e62ec4db309157c5f831f9f4e97a2b"}],"sha":"45029c684e752319f72f0552c881d306da91f3cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/commits/45029c684e752319f72f0552c881d306da91f3cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1749347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cammoraton","id":1749347,"login":"cammoraton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDkzNDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/commits/cbeb2fc964e62ec4db309157c5f831f9f4e97a2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T00:37:29Z","email":"nick.cammorato@gmail.com","name":"Nick Cammorato"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T01:06:02Z","email":"nick.cammorato@gmail.com","name":"Nick Cammorato"},"message":"feat: guided-extraction manifests (range-aware) + reposition as a general KB\n\nRealize the original \"drop in a PDF we know -> guided extraction\" intent, and\nreframe the project as a general knowledge base (pf2e is the flagship, not the\nwhole point).\n\nManifests (pf2e vision pipeline):\n- Range-aware format: an entity''s location is a list of [p] / [start,end] entries,\n  built faithfully from the pages we know (home page + mention-map pages, collapsing\n  contiguous runs) — no heuristic derivation. _build_manifest dedups by name and\n  bounds total_pages to every referenced page.\n- Consumer: _build_pre_candidates_from_manifest expands ranges AND unions mentions\n  (previously ignored), so the extractor gets every page we know, not just the home page.\n- Ship book_manifests/pf2e/ — 179 real books (names + type + page-ranges only, an\n  uncopyrightable factual index; sub-25-entity blogs/society-play/web-supplements/\n  duplicate AP fragments trimmed out).\n- Import: POST /manifests/load-shipped + auto-load on space create; GET /manifests/keys\n  powers a known-book picker on the ingest page.\n- Reconcile existing spaces: POST /spaces/{slug}/apply-preset merges the committed preset\n  (adds processor/distiller/ingest to the corpus spaces).\n\nDocs: README/ARCHITECTURE reframed as a general knowledge base; the two ingestion\npipelines (vision for pf2e, structured for general corpora) documented as peers;\nlicensing note updated for the shipped lean manifests.","tree":{"sha":"acaf673368cbabe12c526ae5e6eb76ac1cdfb65a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/trees/acaf673368cbabe12c526ae5e6eb76ac1cdfb65a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/commits/cbeb2fc964e62ec4db309157c5f831f9f4e97a2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1749347?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h