ttps://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cammoraton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/commits/f3169d2606187e44e837673eba9cb47d83f4fd71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:22:44Z","email":"nick.cammorato@gmail.com","name":"Nick Cammorato"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T23:22:44Z","email":"nick.cammorato@gmail.com","name":"Nick Cammorato"},"message":"chore: repo hygiene — drop AI artifacts & private data, reorganize skills\n\n- Stop shipping docs/ (AI planning/review artifacts: superpowers plans/specs,\n  dated code reviews, test matrices) — kept local. The one genuine guide,\n  TESTING.md, becomes a Claude Code project skill (.claude/skills/testing/).\n- Stop shipping space_manifests/: it''s a private per-space *backup*\n  (scripts/space_manifest.py output — entity metadata + edges + corrections for\n  surviving a DB recreate), not the guided-extraction seed it was mistaken for,\n  and nothing loads it. Relocated locally to data/manifests/ with the other data.\n- Reorganize corpus skills into per-space subdirs (skills/<space>/, skills/shared/\n  for multi-space). The loader already recurses and scope comes from the `spaces:`\n  frontmatter, so this is a pure move (verified: all 56 skills still load).\n- README/CLAUDE: correct the now-false \"ships manifests\" claims + skill layout;\n  the repo now ships no game content or publisher data at all.","tree":{"sha":"117fb670294a370bff132e56dce304bb533099b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/trees/117fb670294a370bff132e56dce304bb533099b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cammoraton/compendium/git/commits