":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arthur-art/micro-frontend-next-react/commits/67128c1954acab7bb90305cda5ee0be67533ce1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T20:06:06Z","email":"arthurteixeira.guts@gmail.com","name":"Arthur Teixeira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T20:06:06Z","email":"arthurteixeira.guts@gmail.com","name":"Arthur Teixeira"},"message":"Refatora acesso a dados com BFF GraphQL e React Query\n\nAdiciona um BFF Node.js em Fastify e Apollo Server que expõe as queries marketLive, catalog e newsFeed, traduzindo as consultas GraphQL para os endpoints REST da API .NET com timeout, CORS, healthcheck e encerramento controlado.\n\nCria um cliente GraphQL compartilhado, integra TanStack React Query com prefetch, dehydrate e HydrationBoundary nos remotes e preserva os ciclos SSR, SSG e ISR sem chamadas diretas do frontend ao backend. Também atualiza scripts, navegação do Host e documentação do fluxo completo.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"448680ebf1a7bac1907b6738caa99b22d89a2987","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arthur-art/micro-frontend-next-react/git/trees/448680ebf1a7bac1907b6738caa99b22d89a2987"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arthur-art/micro-frontend-next-react/git/commits/67128c1954acab7bb90305cda5ee0be67533ce1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54858003?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Arthur-art","id":54858003,"login":"Arthur-art","node_id":"MDQ6