ira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T17:48:06Z","email":"arthurteixeira.guts@gmail.com","name":"Arthur Teixeira"},"message":"Cria demonstração de micro frontends com Next.js e Module Federation\n\nEstrutura um monorepo com um host e dois remotes independentes em Next.js Pages Router, configurados com @module-federation/nextjs-mf e execução conjunta nas portas 5000, 5001 e 5002.\n\nAdiciona um store Zustand singleton compartilhado para demonstrar comunicação em tempo real por contador e mensagem, fixa versões compatíveis de Webpack e enhanced-resolve e documenta instalação, arquitetura e testes no README.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d41426610858df23224b239fe4cad395b7942107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arthur-art/micro-frontend-next-react/git/trees/d41426610858df23224b239fe4cad395b7942107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arthur-art/micro-frontend-next-react/git/commits/6d4bc0ea6d34579c003cd5c8133166f7343c7a5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54858003?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Arthur-art","id":54858003,"login":"Arthur-art","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODU4MDAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arthur-art/subscriptions","type":"User","url":