meterized query)\n- Optimize getStatus() from 3 queries to 1 (scalar subqueries)\n- LLM waitForReady() exponential backoff (200ms → 2s, reduces wasted requests 10x)\n- LLM restartInstance() polling instead of fixed 1s sleep\n- Auto-backup async I/O (writeFile, readdir, unlink from fs/promises)\n- Start embeddingCache.startCleanup() in main.ts (periodic expired entry removal)\n- Optimize createSession() — construct return object directly, no INSERT+SELECT\n- Frontend API: parse server JSON error bodies in all 5 helpers\n- Service worker: activate handler purges old caches, clients.claim()\n- Replace as any casts in document-parser with typed PdfInfo interface","tree":{"sha":"759d104078e20d97eaeecf911617fd3d0374e17a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/trees/759d104078e20d97eaeecf911617fd3d0374e17a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/commits/f32f06f0acc7c124924f5ce89d177d708d3e99b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32136497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jcn363","id":32136497,"login":"jcn363","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTM2NDk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jcn363/chac/c