- src/modules/router/request-logger.ts: structured logging with timing, status, IP\n- GET /api/logs: returns last 1000 requests\n- Colored console output\n\nAuto-Backup:\n- Scheduler task: exports DB to data/backups/backup-<timestamp>.json\n- Settings: scheduler.auto_backup_enabled, auto_backup_interval, backup_retention\n- Automatic cleanup of old backups\n\nGraceful Shutdown:\n- Tracks in-flight requests via middleware counter\n- Drains for up to 10s before force-stopping\n\nTests:\n- 533 tests pass, 0 TypeScript errors, 1050 expect() calls\n- Rate limit disabled in test kernel for isolation","tree":{"sha":"eaaa44de8a4db6e84f5d1044e3d4390b9a2e74d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/trees/eaaa44de8a4db6e84f5d1044e3d4390b9a2e74d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/commits/25c09643171d1f1b172a0fcd88b94d648f2b03a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32136497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jcn363","id":32136497,"login":"jcn363","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTM2NDk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jcn363/chac/commit/25c09643171d1f1b172a0fcd88b94d648f2b03a3","node_id":"C_kwDOT