n- Add loading states for async operations\n- Add focus rings, ARIA labels, keyboard navigation\n- Add responsive layout (sidebar hides on mobile)\n- Add prefers-reduced-motion support\n- Fix: tab switching only targets data-tab buttons\n- Fix: escapeHtml now escapes quotes (prevents data-md corruption)\n- Fix: search highlight auto-scrolls to first match\n- Fix: empty state toggling works with hidden class\n- Fix: drag-reorder validates server response\n- Fix: button:hover scoped to exclude tabs\n- Fix: help overlay has focus trap\n- Fix: export anchor appended to DOM before click\n- Add sort_order column to chat_sessions (migration v2)\n- Add ChatSession.sort_order type field\n- Add DELETE/PUT routes for session management\n- Add tests for deleteSession, updateSession, reorderSessions\n- Update README with all new features and API endpoints\n- Update packages: hono 4.12.28→4.12.29, typescript 5.9.3\n- 99 tests passing","tree":{"sha":"b07c4013862c00efd1415805269d6fccf058bac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/trees/b07c4013862c00efd1415805269d6fccf058bac3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/commits/a5d806b27a76bb59dc178df27dd2c82e8f4efc68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32136497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jcn363","id":32136497,"login":"jcn363","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMTM2NDk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_