github.com/users/jcn363/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcn363","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/commits/1c392010fd27109bcd6e547f91145791f6685af6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:35:26Z","email":"jcn363@gmail.com","name":"jcn363"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:35:26Z","email":"jcn363@gmail.com","name":"jcn363"},"message":"fix: comprehensive audit — 20+ bugs, security, and quality fixes\n\nCritical fixes:\n- Frontend: rename app.ts to app.js so browser can load it\n- Frontend: load chat history when switching sessions\n- Documents: remove broken db.transaction() wrapper (async in sync transaction)\n- Documents: add path traversal prevention (reject .. paths)\n- Chunking: validate overlap < chunkSize to prevent infinite loop\n- LLM: fix ''process'' variable shadowing Bun global\n- LLM: clean up instance map on spawn failure (catch waitForReady)\n- LLM: fix empty input crash in mockEmbedding\n- Shutdown: guard against double-signal race condition\n\nSecurity fixes:\n- Documents: validate file exists before reading\n- Settings API: sanitize error message (no longer reflects user input)\n- Router: add global error-handling middleware\n- Router: return 404 for nonexistent chat sessions\n\nPerformance:\n- LLM: simplify flash_attn flag logic\n- LLM: parallelize instance shutdown instead of sequential\n- Paths: reuse exeName variable (eliminate duplicate computation)\n- API: read docsPerPage from settings on each request (not cached once)\n\nTest fixes:\n- Mock: use deterministic embeddings instead of Math.random()\n\nDocs:\n- README: fix test count, ''bun run'' prefix, tab names, model download note\n- usb-drive: fix Windows download script (wrong models, missing vision)\n- usb-drive: update .gitignore for build artifacts","tree":{"sha":"3673063acb78768bec07eb3e2367d2991c58227d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jcn363/chac/git/trees/3673063acb7876