tps://api.github.com/users/ahmedOumezzine","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmedOumezzine/micro-frontend-ecommerce-platform/commits/7a873ac159f7d765810ce5eb1403db50a8f7d018/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T02:22:48Z","email":"ahmedoumezzine@outlook.fr","name":"ahmed Oumezzine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T02:22:48Z","email":"ahmedoumezzine@outlook.fr","name":"ahmed Oumezzine"},"message":"feat: initialize ecommerce platform with microfrontends architecture\n\n- Added cart-app for managing shopping cart functionality.\n- Introduced catalog-app for displaying product listings with filtering and sorting options.\n- Implemented checkout-app for handling the checkout process and order summary.\n- Created product-detail-app for viewing individual product details.\n- Developed host-app to serve as the main entry point for the application, integrating all microfrontends.\n- Established shared database module for managing products, users, orders, and cart in local storage.\n- Integrated internationalization support with i18n module for multi-language support.\n- Added CSS styles for consistent UI across the application.\n- Set up a simple HTTP server for serving the application.\n- Created package.json for project metadata and scripts.","tree":{"sha":"29897821df341702c8a8fee06aedde845cd0d1c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmedOumezzine/micro-frontend-ecommerce-platform/git/trees/29897821df341702c8a8fee06aedde845cd0d1c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmedOumezzine/micro-frontend-ecommerce-platform/git/commits/7a873ac159f7d765810ce5eb1403db50a8f7d018","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7198296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedOumezzine/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahmedOumezzine/followers","follow