: Mitchel Turner <mitchel.myers.turner@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7caaa1133a75870e40c0f2217b93168a219553b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/git/trees/a7caaa1133a75870e40c0f2217b93168a219553b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/git/commits/3e9686b4a3967debd35f072298b2920ffd480473","verification":{"payload":"tree a7caaa1133a75870e40c0f2217b93168a219553b\nparent 59dc1ec98915c3ec16d650e5b7cb6afec1d736fb\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1783833438 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1783833438 +0000\n\nfeat: ship production-ready Ops Tool frontend for end users\n\nAdd public landing + auth entry, configurable API base URL, SPA static\nserver with /health, and Railway/Docker deploy config so operators can\nregister, sign in, and use compliance tools against the backend API.\n\nCo-authored-by: Mitchel Turner <mitchel.myers.turner@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL3TPHOtu4WoIjx3DjV3cou+tX6ZkqbncvDcWxl4Nx7bsbrodxD9vETLYsbcK8h2oR\n5WnUKtpCNl56UJHikumg4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T05:17:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/commit/3e9686b4a3967debd35f072298b2920ffd480473","node_id":"C_kwDOTUB1ONoAKDNlOTY4NmI0YTM5NjdkZWJkMzVmMDcyMjk4YjI5MjBmZmQ0ODA0NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/commit/59dc1ec98915c3ec16d650e5b7cb6afec1d736fb","sha":"59dc1ec98915c3ec16d650e5b7cb6afec1d736fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/commits/59dc1ec98915c3ec16d650e5b7cb6afec1d736fb"}],"sha":"3e9686b4a3967debd35f072298b2920ffd480473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/commits/3e9686b4a3967debd35f072298b2920ffd480473"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/commits/59dc1ec98915c3ec16d650e5b7cb6afec1d736fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:11:54Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:11:54Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"fix: unblock Railway boot (bind 0.0.0.0, health, non-blocking Redis)\n\nNest was likely never accepting traffic: BullMQ awaited Redis during\nmodule init (hangs without Redis), and listen() did not bind 0.0.0.0.\nAdd /health probes, make jobs optional via REDIS_URL/REDIS_HOST, run\nmigrations on start, and ship backend railway.toml.\n\nCo-authored-by: Mitchel Turner <mitchel.myers.turner@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"3825dd36709bf7339ea2e4d0c9ea4f67089b7a56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/git/trees/3825dd36709bf7339ea2e4d0c9ea4f67089b7a56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MitchelTurner/Ops-Tool/git/commits/59dc1ec98915c3ec16d650e5b7cb6afec1d736fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 3825dd36709bf7339ea2e4d0c9ea4f67089b7a56\nparent 775e9a274491757946fa068f657aa6b0fd1fdfd6\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1783833114 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1783833114 +0000\n\nfix: unblock Railway boot (bind 0.0.0.0, health, non-blocking Redis)\n\nNest was likely never accepting traffic: BullMQ awaited Redis during\nmodule init (hangs without Redis), and listen() did not bind 0.0.0.0.\nAdd /health probes, make jobs optional via REDIS_URL/REDIS_HOST, run\nmigrations on start, and ship backend railway.toml.\n\nCo-authored-by: Mitchel Turner <mitchel.myers.turner@gmail.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQM8pFr8+Pgj1uvViy66VQosX6W/2fTqztWcZENbjQYl221qilk0bU0FDOeuPNyLmDd\n+R/fnb5MK5h2+lQM40FAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T05:11:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_ur