6fb4","node_id":"C_kwDOTUEdKNoAKDJiNThkZGIzZTQzMGJkZmI1MmUwMTQwNmVhNDYzYTFmNDkxYzZmYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commit/6d63194824cfc80160736ec0dd6641effc09080d","sha":"6d63194824cfc80160736ec0dd6641effc09080d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/6d63194824cfc80160736ec0dd6641effc09080d"}],"sha":"2b58ddb3e430bdfb52e01406ea463a1f491c6fb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/2b58ddb3e430bdfb52e01406ea463a1f491c6fb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/6d63194824cfc80160736ec0dd6641effc09080d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T12:33:18Z","email":"Dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T12:33:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(host): file watching via polling on external drives (HMR) (#34)\n\n* fix(host): file watching via polling on external drives (HMR/Fast Refresh)\n\nEn discos externos (/Volumes, APFS) fsevents/Watchman no entregan eventos de cambio\n→ editar código no dispara rebuild ni HMR (solo el Reload manual funciona). No es de\niOS: pasa igual en cualquier plataforma cuando el repo está en un volumen externo.\n\nFix: watchOptions.poll en el rspack del host (env RSPACK_POLL), y `pnpm dev` lo\nauto-activa (1000ms) cuando detecta que el repo está en /Volumes. Polling no depende\nde fsevents → detecta las ediciones siempre. Ignora node_modules.\n\nnode:test 24/24; DEV_DRY en disco externo verificado (loguea el polling + RSPACK_POLL\nen el env del Host).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* fix(host): also set WATCHPACK_POLLING for the external-drive watcher\n\nAdemás de RSPACK_POLL (→ watchOptions.poll, que Re.Pack pasa a compiler.watch),\nsetea WATCHPACK_POLLING para forzar el polling en el watcher (watchpack) directo —\nrobustez por si watchOptions.poll no alcanza en el disco externo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba670bc4a530226533a82a3a129961b3f81f9065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/ba670bc4a530226533a82a3a129961b3f81f9065"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/6d63194824cfc80160736ec0dd6641effc09080d","verification":{"payload":"tree ba670bc4a530226533a82a3a129961b3f81f9065\nparent 617552b6a7898224a34f632e86e8b54436f544bf\nauthor Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo <Dentvega6@gmail.com> 1786710798 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786710798 -0400\n\nfix(host): file watching via polling on external drives (HMR) (#34)\n\n* fix(host): file watching via polling on external drives (HMR/Fast Refresh)\n\nEn discos externos (/Volumes, APFS) fsevents/Watchman no entregan eventos de cambio\n→ editar código no dispara rebuild ni HMR (solo el Reload manual funciona). No es de\niOS: pasa igual en cualquier plataforma cuando el repo está en un volumen externo.\n\nFix: watchOptions.poll en el rspack del host (env RSPACK_POLL), y `pnpm dev` lo\nauto-activa (1000ms) cuando detecta que el repo está en /Volumes. Polling no depende\nde fsevents → detecta las ediciones siempre. Ignora node_modules.\n\nnode:test 24/24; DEV_DRY en disco externo verificado (loguea el polling + RSPACK_POLL\nen el env del Host).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* fix(host): also set WATCHPACK_POLLING for the external-drive watcher\n\nAdemás de RSPACK_POLL (→ watchOptions.poll, que Re.Pack pasa a compiler.watch),\nsetea WATCHPACK_POLLING para forzar el polling en el watcher (watchpack) directo —\nrobustez por si watchOptions.poll no alcanza en el disco externo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfwsOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5jsQAJ+Qk5pQ+mqXBMZOv2umWt+9\nk8d0zpFmJ/lqBnmm58VIj+M0pajxKN3DRIA+40wUllqKAjYo5ohWGB86fieY+4tb\npIgikDGzN+zCPK00EUvcCUm0qmPVQz+M+gfMSAVcQi42KCr6qoxieDHe5NXFA3PT\nG0dzeZrvxSlQLFGSZ+xuzk3+VVPAn3Nn6cJne0Z5bHGjWW6sv1FCbE3RCEHPeZUk\nhG3q4NC5u1ZNfRXwyloOBP/9CvIiAgC4g6bTrJOpkvzh4d6AB+oANZPU0gYUhBCx\nQqQ88wWeuxo0DSjFcJ/3oBv/DPrSazeD8zRU0SwQ25bAesfq+xBRocRGwTC1PsXD\nKsJzh8YXPMzZD7GbcHQO955ybDQtsWWyRCeo8/aolgWURWsythszlm3xgW2V1y7I\nJeGJkfGBH+mA6Kg1swIsRmgtqOXUtoumsAp6/UM53NyOSoVjqIMN07262WLG0NbB\n3n29ietEf+ZLQSWgogpm8wf6UlJ09Gdlb80wqessQomzrNZo5B1dkPAZOZOgQg20\nNN4Oik2pkX7leiT5YQhMoViZyZ7r2DDej6MnEuqKLNfNfQnIMftEWG6yF1L2RGQS\n