EyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/3d37d702eb5ac986ee94e3cda11b52d1f4022337/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:32:51Z","email":"Dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:32:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(host): pnpm dev — adb reverse over every connected device (#27)\n\nCon 2+ devices/emuladores Android conectados, el `adb reverse` del orquestador\nfallaba con \"adb: more than one device/emulator\" (no especificaba target). Ahora\nel proc adb-reverse loopea sobre CADA device conectado (`adb -s <serial> reverse`),\nasí funciona con 1 o varios; no-op si no hay devices android (iOS sim). Test\nactualizado. Verificado contra un setup real de 2 devices (físico + emulador).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec05b03c50c894eb3eb04111a3e9372b87422d63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/ec05b03c50c894eb3eb04111a3e9372b87422d63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/3d37d702eb5ac986ee94e3cda11b52d1f4022337","verification":{"payload":"tree ec05b03c50c894eb3eb04111a3e9372b87422d63\nparent 24f4ade745528463874062cb9e01df942e3b7f2e\nauthor Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo <Dentvega6@gmail.com> 1786689171 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786689171 -0400\n\nfix(host): pnpm dev — adb reverse over every connected device (#27)\n\nCon 2+ devices/emuladores Android conectados, el `adb reverse` del orquestador\nfallaba con \"adb: more than one device/emulator\" (no especificaba target). Ahora\nel proc adb-reverse loopea sobre CADA device conectado (`adb -s <serial> reverse`),\nasí funciona con 1 o varios; no-op si no hay devices android (iOS sim). Test\nactualizado. Verificado contra un setup real de 2 devices (físico + emulador).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfraTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2QQQAE5DgVYMQJMRWQtI35I+9RhB\nUi5TAN7UaT/Fab3cJHd4RPaa0XwcwVFgUiqKRB5GuPI0GxrybDSna9lso5P7OrB8\nURoOGiA/grJLYZK2a4MKyA2BnCnLiSHpUBS0YCxCK5nART9NvFo6BxmGj8tgzTZM\nU4f1UB6ARWoQlF2PLB91QTr37oI9GWlAEcq6XMPrlkCq6SHGQrRsP/DaJptYu9KM\nbtWr+RDAxwau7IwwMrKVnaXU0ESdpWhp7TdTPKsIsmPLyXrLLT8mSfskZLsgufJm\n7eZcaA8gnU0K+hgifja4CBolxye7TEnN1dt9M3/SFnN2FhPfdyTpv+fIXa56Pr5U\nb8dc4giCHJi9KLH2qPq6gy0NchbPCOeT9fKJryFtuH8CLR4KuWz4eoFl2MT+DZdf\nRP3vaENYNf5wAnFp56mVNeArAyu593BsLgjh8LtuyzQwCGQP71BobA50e5takdSk\n9vdpQmQsZKOo/ud3LwzkJn/Hh2dvF8nHic6RHkJ1gbz0DQMrgyDVt9u4ZdaCTqMm\njulw5UsEcfVBG579aL1zME3QExdIDI5mboEFCG3ugO5wvOkBCDBMMdtWP0JIp/3b\n7Dym9o5qNDRcZZlhUnmXH3lJd0WVoQYKod5jysaMk3J4tq+XjDX7CiiWZLZLoUaN\nPQUt56CgDCxWYQ4QvMKZ\n=1xD3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T06:35:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow"