e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/24f4ade745528463874062cb9e01df942e3b7f2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:04:57Z","email":"Dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T06:04:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host): pnpm dev — declarative dev-loop orchestrator (mprocs) (#26)\n\nUn comando maneja el dev-loop desde un config declarativo por-miniapp, en vez de\narmar env vars + adb reverse + N dev servers a mano.\n\n- Config: apps/host/dev-miniapps.config.mjs (gitignored; .example commiteado) —\n  [{id, path, mode:''mount''|''remote'', port?, autostart}]. path a repos hermanos,\n  mantenido a mano.\n- scripts/dev-plan.mjs (puro): buildDevPlan → deriva DEV_MINIAPP_PATHS, DEV_REMOTES,\n  adb ports, procs; valida (port faltante/duplicado, mode, id, cap de 6 mounts).\n  toMprocsYaml → genera la config de mprocs. Test node:test (8).\n- scripts/dev.mjs (pnpm dev): carga config (fallback al .example), buildDevPlan,\n  escribe el yaml y corre mprocs via npx (sin dep dura → sin riesgo en CI). DEV_DRY=1\n  imprime plan+yaml sin arrancar.\n- mprocs: 1 proc Host (con env derivado) + 1 por remote (autostart del config,\n  togglable en el TUI) + adb-reverse (one-shot) + app-android/ios on-demand.\n- Backward-compat: DEV_MINIAPP_PATHS/DEV_REMOTES manuales siguen andando.\n\nVerificado: node:test 8/8, dry-run end-to-end resuelve paths + genera YAML correcto.\nSpec: backstage-web/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-14-dev-orchestrator-design.md\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac0c9bd2b424819485ac6c88c3a0c71fa27ee96c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/ac0c9bd2b424819485ac6c88c3