t\n  (name = manifest.id; caps del manifest).\n- DevMountScreen importa los 6 slots estáticamente (→ todos en el bundle → editar\n  cualquiera Fast-Refreshea) y muestra un selector (tabs) cuando hay ≥2; el grant se\n  arma de las caps de la miniapp elegida.\n- Parsing puro en scripts/dev-miniapps.mjs (CSV > single, dedupe, trim, cap) con\n  test node:test (6 casos).\n\ntsc OK, jest 14/14, node:test 6/6. Metadata verificada contra los manifests reales.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4720d76540df9be20dfe79502f7910e32a0cd175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/4720d76540df9be20dfe79502f7910e32a0cd175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/6683e5823676f652f6ecea79ff7758589479b020","verification":{"payload":"tree 4720d76540df9be20dfe79502f7910e32a0cd175\nparent 4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a\nauthor Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo <Dentvega6@gmail.com> 1786625915 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786625915 -0400\n\nfeat(host): dev-mount multiple miniapps with a picker (Mode 1) (#25)\n\nDev-mount (Mode 1) ahora soporta VARIAS miniapps a la vez con Fast Refresh en todas.\n\n- Nuevo DEV_MINIAPP_PATHS (CSV) además del DEV_MINIAPP_PATH singular (back-compat).\n- rspack aliasea @dev-miniapp-0..5 (MAX_DEV_MINIAPPS=6) a cada Entry local (slots\n  vacíos → NoMiniapp), e inyecta __DEV_MINIAPPS__ = [{name, capabilities}] por slot\n  (name = manifest.id; caps del manifest).\n- DevMountScreen importa los 6 slots estáticamente (→ todos en el bundle → editar\n  cualquiera Fast-Refreshea) y muestra un selector (tabs) cuando hay ≥2; el grant se\n  arma de las caps de la miniapp elegida.\n- Parsing puro en scripts/dev-miniapps.mjs (CSV > single, dedupe, trim, cap) con\n  test node:test (6 casos).\n\ntsc OK, jest 14/14, node:test 6/6. Metadata verificada contra 