_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commit/6683e5823676f652f6ecea79ff7758589479b020","node_id":"C_kwDOTUEdKNoAKDY2ODNlNTgyMzY3NmY2NTJmNmVjZWE3OWZmNzc1ODU4OTQ3OWIwMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commit/4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a","sha":"4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a"}],"sha":"6683e5823676f652f6ecea79ff7758589479b020","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/6683e5823676f652f6ecea79ff7758589479b020"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T12:11:31Z","email":"Dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T12:11:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(host): dev-loop Mode 2 — bypass script cache for dev-remotes (hot reload) (#24)\n\nAunque Mode 2 cargaba, editar la miniapp no se reflejaba ni tras recargar: Re.Pack\ncachea los scripts en disco por default (cache: true), así que el host servía el\nbundle viejo. El resolver no desactivaba la caché para dev-remotes.\n\nFix: los scripts que vienen del dev server (URL con query `?platform=…`) se resuelven\ncon `cache: false` → cada reload refetchea fresco. Chunks publicados (sin query)\nmantienen el cache default → sin cambios en release. Heurística en `isDevServerUrl`\n(chunkUrls.ts) con test.\n\nSigue siendo reload manual (RR), no Fast Refresh — eso es inherente a la federación;\npara edit→instantáneo está el Mode 1 (dev-mount).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"350ae1575a3f2766083171ccb678a26b978c35d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/350ae1575a3f2766083171ccb678a26b978c35d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a","verification":{"payload":"tree 350ae1575a3f2766083171ccb678a26b978c35d7\nparent 4bd9d97e378ebe4d66f9464772c2b31fea8b35a7\nauthor Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo <Dentvega6@gmail.com> 1786623091 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786623091 -0400\n\nfix(host): dev-loop Mode 2 — bypass script cache for dev-remotes (hot reload) (#24)\n\nAunque Mode 2 cargaba, editar la miniapp no se reflejaba ni tras recargar: Re.Pack\ncachea los scripts en disco por default (cache: true), así que el host servía el\nbundle viejo. El resolver no desactivaba la caché para dev-remotes.\n\nFix: los scripts que vienen del dev server (URL con query `?platform=…`) se resuelven\ncon `cache: false` → cada reload refetchea fresco. Chunks publicados (sin query)\nmantienen el cache default → sin cambios en release. Heurística en `isDevServerUrl`\n(chunkUrls.ts) con test.\n\nSigue siendo reload manual (RR), no Fast Refresh — eso es inherente a la federación;\npara edit→instantáneo está el Mode 1 (dev-mount).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfbRzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIS8QAKEsVFyAv15a4SZ8BIP8ep7F\nhXhhYaRX8GvDRU1Rigt7UWviSB9TllhpIHEsWPmWDiavvuDuG5125aiGnVayVXBo\nv3X889EypXMZvMuAcQW14ELap0OtkW7mOM3aR6JfkE31SpxhuBuof1HT4rmqDBnK\ne9X5LQw4ULqZHB4zWct2kiwNyIfLfgFD4775L5dspPxbcGjIEjAZpofRMzm0EChn\ncKYz05/nPx03AqEMIR7gjAyuL23QFAmIbhchAwlchtUltQixw3F6zPtLTIwUSZbz\nIdQygzTRWPX0aUaSNSyjBdLrOvoezCAe0EsN2LwzoiGyjQ+zY6DtckSxdhQS4iyF\nHf8hfw9CHhtl0tltlSN6SRZq3a8d5/vIUQc3X6MnzfJzQLCNkCBblrlFNkrpi7VX\nWbUsugUyXFYdevz7Z5ooZDVMrf/M8FwF2nDxmWyWWIcXNDBrVT67mMFFEgnzbzyq\nBZFJLTBXVdZx6lgyV/owGmzrtHQHXEE8G7qUqe4WK891G+a70Db57dFaWFlg6S9J\npukvRuKGkzmHtf7mhLKXCcsqenrbb7LZm+BOHsHjbmS1RPcfJGQ64s8kR9A9iQMD\nTlcuJJt5dS0h3+G6Ps+Vf60c1Crx8+ucX4Raub9yRGtNfEWKsL1e10jBkul8vT2/\noxo9FHuscl15vdDEIbfE\n=/t6w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T12:41:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commit/4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a","node_id":"C_kwDOTUEdKNoAKDRlYjMzNTMwZTc3YzMxMDdiMmUyMDBjMjU1MTExNGNhMzMwMzY2MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commit/4bd9d97e378ebe4d66f9464772c2b31fea8b35a7","sha":"4bd9d97e378ebe4d66f9464772c2b31fea8b35a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/4bd9d97e378ebe4d66f9464772c2b31fea8b35a7"}],"sha":"4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/4eb33530e77c3107b2e200c2551114ca3303660a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/4bd9d97e378ebe4d66f9464772c2b31fea8b35a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T11:59:24Z","email":"Dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T11:59:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(host): carry ?platform query on dev-remote sub-chunks (dev-loop Mode 2) (#23)\n\nEn Mode 2 (DEV_REMOTES → dev server :9000), el container cargaba pero sus\nsub-chunks (__federation_expose_Entry, vendors-*) daban 404: devResolveClient\nle pone `?platform=android` a la URL del container, pero chunkLoader derivaba la\nbase de los chunks con `url.replace(/\\/[^/]*$/,''/'')` (que borra la query) y armaba\n`${base}${scriptId}.chunk.bundle` sin ella. El webpack-start exige `?platform` → 404.\n\nFix: se preserva la query del container y se re-agrega a cada sub-chunk. Lógica\nextraída a un módulo puro `chunkUrls.ts` (chunkBaseAndQuery + remoteChunkUrl) con\ntest de regresión. Chunks publicados (R2/Backstage) no tienen query → sin cambios.\n\nVerificado empíricamente: el dev server devuelve 404 sin la query y 200 con ella.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af4a2a1f709fe0a0fd45a955a5fff959933a531d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/af4a2a1f709fe0a0fd45a955a5fff959933a531d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/4bd9d97e378ebe4d66f9464772c2b31fea8b35a7","verification":{"payload":"tree af4a2a1f709fe0a0fd45a955a5fff959933a531d\nparent 9d05b5e14aa31dfbf5bbbf4515de8b98ebb38602\nauthor Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo <Dentvega6@gmail.com> 1786622364 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786622364 -0400\n\nfix(host): carry ?platform query on dev-remote sub-chunks (dev-loop Mode 2) (#23)\n\nEn Mode 2 (DEV_REMOTES → dev server :9000), el container cargaba pero sus\nsub-chunks (__federation_expose_Entry, vendors-*) daban 404: devResolveClient\nle pone `?platform=android` a la URL del container, pero chunkLoader derivaba la\nbase de los chunks con `url.replace(/\\/[^/]*$/,''/'')` (que borra la query) y armaba\n`${base}${scriptId}.chunk.bundle` sin ella. El webpack-start exige `?platform` → 404.\n\nFix: se preserva la query del container y se re-agrega a cada sub-chunk. Lógica\nextraída a un módulo puro `chunkUrls.ts` (chunkBaseAndQuery + remoteChunkUrl) con\ntest de regresión. Chunks publicados (R2/Backstage) no tienen query → sin cambios.\n\nVerificado empíricamente: el dev server devuelve 404 sin la query y 200 con ella.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfbGcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1HkQABiokraJwW1OhCwLYRs8BDOt\n+w22FO0xZrRG3lGX9DNBhHcrTPQ+Fs8MJBI5HnItVBr1Ck5UlSgjtA148ivj+8jQ\n8rHk2fhiwNGNNPTa8sJx1iJvak1atsJ7nZ+itShyY5Qnkx4kpCmNgASVeqBZL5tA\n4oOV+v6HIIXS7Q2Wa054GjOTyyp6b5JYRF3wTOfInyvMq6lJj0X3IBl9/Fq63pSZ\n16T4nOBp5UsOWHjgz1JbLnV5ZGFZwVEA749gPRmTKrv8+x20DTiZWfoAVajXGsf1\n8dmJSLZilrvV69yeKr/OGqszFDZGbMFdczftqnrDXxnSMLqW3l81c/tSNUNBRal5\n8A6WRktHraucJLrhiYWJ6bSNDMJkupTTUZwCVWgJYR+t+MFHEaoez+JU1wm54LY7\nQ6PvR0EbQtja1WCdFmAs6w9UGlEAY0KNMUuXay3VY62hIPJ3ZC9T6nGbvAaaAer/\ngIyNhEkd2mACR5dJJmQl4/WBIcdBwWLMXXWSifNrc7iKy7da6HbSnr97FvBSMeTt\nn3zNHzg8EPNYAOVeds+qYcItl6F5vEnkAowfHfUyDpMNTpiNXC6F6ZKQ8tjytF0J\nW08O1g7L5e3GugooLgN+hovOmyFUfS4AwzuAdcByvNcRsJkbHjFS7V5ldrwx2Dyn\n/nrpar+vLKQE/1KnWNPe\n=urER\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T12:09:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id"