7f3439fc852bcb65715e7016e32181c207c0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/f978a0465f966850d373e62b772c5a0e7e15e86e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:39:35Z","email":"Dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T08:39:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(host-runtime): UX de errores — auto-retry + retry self-contained (#3)\n\n* docs(spec): host error UX — self-contained retry, retryable vs permanent, 1 auto-retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* docs(plan): host error UX implementation plan + cache-as-next-step note\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* feat(host-runtime): isRetryable — classify transient vs permanent fallbacks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* feat(host-runtime): useMiniapp auto-retries transient failures + exposes reload/retrying\n\nLoop de intentos: 1 auto-retry (default) con backoff en razones retryables\n(resolve/download/integrity-failed), respetando cancelled durante el sleep.\nreload() da un budget fresco; retrying refleja el auto-retry en vuelo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* feat(host-runtime): retry button only for retryable fallbacks + built-in reload + retrying UI\n\nRetry button (onRetry ?? reload) shows only for transient reasons; permanent\nones (skew/invalid-manifest) show a terminal message with no retry. Loading\nshows \"Reintentando…\" during an auto-retry. New retry? prop passthrough.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* test(host-runtime): auto-retry + retryable/permanent + manual reload behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* ci(host-compat): run blast-radius on all PRs, skip heavy work when host deps unchanged\n\nThe required blast-radius check had a `paths:` filter, so PRs that don''t touch host\ndeps never triggered it → stuck \"Expected — waiting for status\", blocking merge.\nNow the job always runs (always reports the check) but only does the real blast-radius\nwork when apps/host deps or the lockfile changed; otherwise it passes clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c6cf5d1739aad02717f2143eb786f2f25c1bbc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/9c6cf5d1739aad02717f2143eb786f2f25c1bbc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/f978a0465f966850d373e62b772c5a0e7e15e86e","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c6cf5d1739aad02717f2143eb786f2f25c1bbc5\nparent 28c2d8cb206218d42f8b87d0d0016b18ad522b80\nauthor Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo <Dentvega6@gmail.com> 1785746375 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785746375 -0400\n\nfeat(host-runtime): UX de errores — auto-retry + retry self-contained (#3)\n\n* docs(spec): host error UX — self-contained retry, retryable vs permanent, 1 auto-retry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* docs(plan): host error UX implementation plan + cache-as-next-step note\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* feat(host-runtime): isRetryable — classify transient vs permanent fallbacks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* feat(host-runtime): useMiniapp auto-retries transient failures + exposes reload/retrying\n\nLoop de intentos: 1 auto-retry (default) con backoff en razones retryables\n(resolve/download/integrity-failed), respetando cancelled durante el sleep.\nreload() da un budget fresco; retrying refleja el auto-retry en vuelo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* feat(host-runtime): retry button only for retryable fallbacks + built-in reload + retrying UI\n\nRetry button (onRetry ?? reload) shows only for transient reasons; permanent\nones (skew/invalid-manifest) show a terminal message with no retry. Loading\nshows \"Reintentando…\" during an auto-retry. New retry? prop passthrough.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* test(host-runtime): auto-retry + retryable/permanent + manual reload behavior\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n* ci(host-compat): run blast-radius on all PRs, skip heavy work when host deps unchanged\n\nThe required blast-radius check had a `paths:` filter, so PRs that don''t touch host\ndeps never triggered it → stuck \"Expected — waiting for status\", blocking merge.\nNow the job always runs (always reports the check) but only does the real blast-radius\nwork when apps/host deps or the lockfile changed; otherwise it passes clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcFPHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl/sQADnWdKPQNRF4KhVgsjjEU6Cl\nvyTI7r4sQeeeKmtaqgqpJ/XXUT1wAHTYBKdKZ34qdjBBA8WzHaupWz6ydHWzw9rf\ndRDenBa/HAF8IN91wyzbmFZAPqPAAVHqPiGGifDjTbQa6v8K8AJ/9k/bzXA6Z8Kl\n581gnSHmbRkSUZyiFPSBnE9J9gMY+skYcFaoghjE1ziaGX7PBikBXnGYtd3mXQ94\na2XMb8CsQ/QRX831y9ZVJxesxO5JbwmfDGVdG0rXoTksBGk30b4sqG8LU7NyNPOu\n1dNZuaSkPDsc8NUQCw7fQnNDteEfb+XllOGfVAc9xAw2qFMaaPqByNDpP7S71Sh9\nGgGJyZSUdgJ4L1R8S8kRN9C2MptsXCecUWfbKZ2AETB7obom7LHi20IxJTl6cPRd\nuol/GgzctEv5+96KVPHLT0oSCu3Luk3fAcxGycy5CFhLP9LjtKxIRguqYuYSc/M5\nqIvQ9212KkDmePUSXhl3jXB0pMzJKPFhS9hxj99CNMZHWAbhlPvzzxpkO1E1pbEH\nFQcvQLQNMse41/SxL7smceq/InfH8cde3IP6tcmSiqTMvIIbZr+YnKqVH2fuPTy6\nklFlTHXDEG2kpR0J0CtIlQuQJiqbAf215EAZ6aJHQMR/dCnqbXRRiKKAWt2Yzuou\nnDyLKYIikmnaNDmNSptI\n=SX/n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-03T08:39:36Z"}},"committer