a","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/commits/28c2d8cb206218d42f8b87d0d0016b18ad522b80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T09:25:39Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T09:25:39Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"feat(host): blast-radius gate — block dep changes that break published miniapps\n\nAdds check-host-compat.mjs, the host''s governance gate: generates the\ncandidate contract via the real gen-host-contract.mjs, fetches the\npublished host-contract + fleet manifests (GET /api/manifests), and uses\nfindNewlyBroken() (real checkCompatibility from @dentvega/miniapp-contract)\nto flag only miniapps that transition compatible→incompatible. Rollout-safe:\nno published contract skips with a warning; ACCEPT_BREAKING=true allows with\na logged record; otherwise exits 1 on a breaking transition.\n\nAdds .github/workflows/host-compat.yml at the repo root (GitHub only reads\nroot workflows) gated on apps/host/package.json, apps/host/shared-deps.mjs,\nand pnpm-lock.yaml changes, with an accept-breaking-contract label override.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"f4bfe40778116d4c4cf2c87ce536f202dbff86a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereac