0T08:42:05Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T08:42:05Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"refactor(host): single source of MF shared deps (behavior-preserving)\n\nExtracts the Module Federation `shared` block out of rspack.config.mjs\ninto apps/host/shared-deps.mjs (SHARED_DEPS + buildMfShared), so it can\nbe reused by the upcoming Host Contract generator without duplicating\nthe list. buildMfShared(SHARED_DEPS, pkgVersion) produces the exact same\nobject ModuleFederationPluginV2({ shared }) received before, verified by\na node:test snapshot. Also makes jest ignore apps/host/scripts/ so the\ngenerator''s node:test files aren''t picked up by the RN jest preset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"9d3a49ce08b23fccb9f25a1442da5e0889b454a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/trees/9d3a49ce08b23fccb9f25a1442da5e0889b454a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstagereactnative/git/commits/a538a43fd492ad375cd3f37ab2a5a4b4b6eed416","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.