a Hidalgo"},"message":"fix(docs): rewrite relative doc links so /docs has zero broken links\n\nCrawl del sitio /docs renderizado (19 páginas, 1203 links internos) encontró 48\nlinks cross-doc rotos: los autores escriben `./OTRA-DOC.md#anchor` (relativo al\n.md) pero el sitio sirve cada doc en /docs/<slug> → `./OTRA-DOC.md` resolvía a\n/docs/OTRA-DOC.md (404). Eran pre-existentes (desde el lanzamiento del sitio).\n\nFix sistémico en el pipeline de render (rehype), no link-por-link:\n- link a otro doc del sitio → /docs/<slug>#anchor (mapea por nombre de archivo → nav)\n- link a un archivo del repo → GitHub blob (backstage-web o repo hermano)\n- anchors same-page / absolutos / http / mailto quedan intactos\nAsí los autores siguen escribiendo links .md naturales y funcionan.\n\nVerificado: re-crawl → 0 links rotos, 0 anchors inexistentes; vitest 368/368\n(6 nuevos de rewriteHref); tsc + build OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"87bfa25793ee89f705ab3c3abd49a9e227915475","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstage-web/git/trees/87bfa25793ee89f705ab3c3abd49a9e227915475"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/backstage-web/git/commits/fc885c434750e7ecacd0794209c0f0a7e95537b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","receiv