ner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/commits/77c1601dc8f79bf7441e5ce6221ed3a3e072d671/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T23:10:00Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T23:10:00Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"fix(sync): remove newly-created ignored files (not just restore existing ones)\n\nThe exclusion loop used `git checkout HEAD -- <path>`, which only restores paths\npresent in HEAD. A protected path the miniapp didn''t have yet (e.g. publish.yml)\nwas created by the merge and couldn''t be dropped → the push included a workflow\nfile and GitHub rejected it. Fall back to `git rm` for created ignored files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"2b1083b5473d9e661c6e59212f95150d273e3d8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/trees/2b1083b5473d9e661c6e59212f95150d273e3d8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/commits/77c1601dc8f79bf7441e5ce6221ed3a3e072d671","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organi