6037c68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:47:07Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:47:07Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"fix(ci): timeout react-native config so a hung invocation degrades to [] (not a stuck CI step)\n\nFinal-review minor: execSync had no timeout; a stuck `react-native config` would\nhang the publish step instead of falling into the best-effort catch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"e42e5ac24455dcb61d6c53b6525a4c222049b9e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/trees/e42e5ac24455dcb61d6c53b6525a4c222049b9e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/commits/9c584096da25d115b42e92d3e517d2cd66037c68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/miniapp-template/commit/9c584096da25d115b42e92d3e517d2cd66037c68","node_id":"C_kwDOTUEgxNoAKDljNTg0MDk2ZGEyNWQxMTViNDJlOTJkM2U1MTdkMmNkNjYwMzdjNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/miniapp-template/commit/68e505cfcd3cf4a2a7707d48d97e530c8bb0d2ae","sha":"68e505cfcd3cf4a2a7707d48d97e530c8bb0d2ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/commits/68e505cfcd3cf4a2a7707d48d97e530c8bb0d2ae"}],"sha":"9c584096da25d115b42e92d3e517d2cd66037c68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/commits/9c584096da25d115b42e92d3e517d2cd66037c68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/commits/68e505cfcd3cf4a2a7707d48d97e530c8bb0d2ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:42:52Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:42:52Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"feat(ci): check-compat blocks native modules absent from the host\n\nAdds a pure checkNatives(contractNativeModules, manifestNativeModules)\nset-difference and combines it with checkSkew in the CLI verdict.\nWarn-first/rollout-safe preserved: no contract → skip (exit 0);\nincompatible (skew OR missing native) → warn by default (exit 0),\nexit 1 only with COMPAT_ENFORCE=1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"2e301965bb60c5f7a65a40a640942340fd01fb8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/trees/2e301965bb60c5f7a65a40a640942340fd01fb8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/commits/68e505cfcd3cf4a2a7707d48d97e530c8bb0d2ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/miniapp-template/commit/68e505cfcd3cf4a2a7707d48d97e530c8bb0d2ae","node_id":"C_kwDOTUEgxNoAKDY4ZTUwNWNmY2QzY2Y0YTJhNzcwN2Q0OGQ5N2U1Mz