 config`.\nAdds a pure parseAutolinkedNatives(rnConfig) (dep is native if android\nor ios platform config is non-null) and a best-effort\nminiappNativeModules() runner that never throws (react-native config\nfailure → nativeModules: []). Write still gated behind the existing\n`if (contract)` block, so no-contract stays a no-op.\n\nFiles:\n- scripts/gen-manifest-shared.mjs\n- scripts/__tests__/gen-manifest-shared.test.mjs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"00476e71ab7e68689570050d6f759761cd2bc9ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/trees/00476e71ab7e68689570050d6f759761cd2bc9ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/commits/9bea3dd65eedc8471cd24d23cee4cac3d89ea6cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12928168?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega","id":12928168,"login":"DentVega","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTI4MTY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DentVega/miniapp-template/commit/9bea3dd65eedc8471cd24d23c