//api.github.com/users/DentVega/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DentVega","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/commits/478eec2dc4684f68e8a9029cfa72b7e3bbf4a8aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T13:16:09Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T13:16:09Z","email":"dentvega6@gmail.com","name":"Brian Dennis Vega Hidalgo"},"message":"feat(ci): gen-manifest-shared — truthful manifest.shared from real deps\n\nAdds scripts/gen-manifest-shared.mjs: derives manifest.json''s `shared`\n(+ minHostContract) from the miniapp''s real installed deps intersected\nwith the host contract fetched from Backstage, replacing the\nhand-written `shared` array that could drift/lie. Self-contained (no\ncontract-package import), no new deps.\n\nRollout-safe: if the host contract isn''t published yet (404 or fetch\nerror), the script skips and leaves manifest.json unchanged — CLI only\nrequires BACKSTAGE_URL. Guarded against import-time execution so\nderiveShared() can be unit-tested in isolation via node:test.\n\nAlso adds jest.config.js (didn''t exist before) so jest ignores\nscripts/ — node:test now owns scripts/**/*.test.mjs while jest''s\n\"no tests found\" behavior for this template is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MPXCf3ev2d17B2N5RgKVJS","tree":{"sha":"cb2116c961b4063b3e243ddc3f7a51a8d4dee884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DentVega/miniapp-template/git/trees/cb2116c961b4063b3e243ddc3f7a51a8d4dee884"},"url":