cs creatures playground\n\nThree.js + Rapier creatures assembled from basic shapes (boxes, spheres,\ncylinders, capsules) with 1-4 leg pairs. Walking is fully physics-driven:\njoint motors follow gait phases while PD controllers handle balance,\nheight (with gait-synced bob and sway) and steering. Creatures can be\ngrabbed and thrown ragdoll-style and recover back to walking.\n\nShips as a standalone site and as an embeddable <creature-playground>\nweb component (dist-lib) for micro-frontend hosts. Includes a headless\nphysics smoke test (npm run test:sim).","tree":{"sha":"fee3564e17b417acb9f89f3708e1c322b489daa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feelsrat/creature-playground/git/trees/fee3564e17b417acb9f89f3708e1c322b489daa4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Feelsrat/creature-playground/git/commits/8970dbe40ba8716f535ac75ae6df99cc0a3be44a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40744868?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Feelsrat","id":40744868,"login":"Feelsrat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzQ0ODY4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Feelsrat","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Feelsrat/creature-playground/commit/8970dbe40ba8716f535ac7