:{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:29:38Z","email":"3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tosdan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:29:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: isolate admin discovery scenarios (T0+T1) (#7)\n\n* test: add isolated admin discovery acceptance scenarios (T0+T1)\n\nAdd a dedicated standalone instance (mockxy-discovery) with the admin API\nenabled, the nine runtime settings declared explicitly and its seed copied\nto tmpfs. Discovery tests read /info, /config, /runtime/status and\n/openapi.yaml from the container and validate the JSON answers against\nthe schemas of the served spec, never the host checkout.\n\nAccess checks cover the admin-disabled image with proxy fallback (404 from\nthe engine, not the backend), a disallowed Host (403) and cross-origin\nreads from the browser on all three engines.\n\nDocument ownership of mutable state per instance in the README and track\nprogress in CHECKLIST-ACCEPTANCE-v1.4.1.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: link PR #7 in the acceptance checklist\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72d7b6ae02254047f1048b63a97be5f2d0038b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/trees/72d7b6ae02254047f1048b63a97be5f2d0038b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/commits/5658b40edc3666b9446b87b991333da50d8c648f","verification":{"payload":"tree 72d7b6ae02254047f1048b63a97be5f2d0038b07\nparent c192743c2dc6d3996b85b1641c5ebfd36c1d68a7\nauthor tosdan <3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com> 1790785778 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790785778 +0200\n\ntest: isolate admin discovery scenarios (T0+T1) (#7)\n\n* test: add isolated admin discovery acceptance scenarios (T0+T1)\n\nAdd a dedicated standalone instance (mockxy-discovery) with the admin API\nenabled, the nine runtime settings declared explicitly and its seed copied\nto tmpfs. Discovery tests read /info, /config, /runtime/status and\n/openapi.yaml from the container and validate the JSON answers against\nthe schemas of the served spec, never the host checkout.\n\nAccess checks cover the admin-disabled image with proxy fallback (404 from\nthe engine, not the backend), a disallowed Host (403) and cross-origin\nreads from the browser on all three engines.\n\nDocument ownership of mutable state per instance in the README and track\nprogress in CHECKLIST-ACCEPTANCE-v1.4.1.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: link PR #7 in the acceptance checklist\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvTjyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcFsQAKA84GBb4NjOXtgOWdLzBpvR\nnrKYf5ifEwPix9rj/dDW0DLaBRmvIpGrVClH4pQi2UmVq7EuCkgKrkO0FMq8AlOK\nZ0FbIjWWDJfYNRC+TijducUjZwwfz11oT2XUmY2TmMzOhe/RjhGjuhuEi+g4B3CD\nWF8mFP8+TJae6gWCsEf8f3zPnVhO5EX9c6dduwrzgi5iJAmXTA0+8xHDWTM+kCDV\ng9A35xhBH+GfLX8KEakBExF3VBkYo+aBwNteru5ZEmF0MOmtt9R57XwoLSBKC3NQ\nNB0KexDSDXueiwEflR6UuSs8y2U+247DCY3ZbgGJbKADmC/Y1DqB+zLPNsqgkQQh\n5pWJjyT5X2ugwIfRsfNWz+pB2hHzGAC8PBSkyx+Q2XstZkNfXm9+sSoOnxHQKO+y\nNhFoO0eJKdvVwK5i6KgddJ76CIbpoSjzz0CSJfNWVRz0+VctQzfCMCVQIO/cpgZI\nIK3Bj2zk+G4AWoDHBxZvvt1gx1HZzG57HrkVTZKx3GINmjIGGKL+gW8x5TVrM/I6\nfXilnhBJjTfWd6YnUG3QjM5g0m8rDnjIC6LgEdEsELPoii/3TW+x/43tR7qf2jcY\nl+1L5vo6WkmW9illq/yQOhcSPThSfKeB1z5LAIhvvsFZfCvk7PvQgJxHyrHmmOf5\ncygfxdAXDhYV5ym8wTGR\n=jo9+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T16:29:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.c