2OTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/commits/d4d39def8e833b1bb4f2f10f26db67b684e9f387/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T23:03:56Z","email":"3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tosdan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T23:03:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: acceptance dei mock WebSocket + micro app di prova manuale ws/sse (#3)\n\n* test(fixtures): mock ws di workspace (copione, regole, close, console)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R8GYUx4crbg9A1eYXv1asb\n\n* test(ws): acceptance dei mock WebSocket dal browser\n\nHelper wsCollect (timestamp per la consegna progressiva, chiusura dal\nserver osservabile) e socket nominate wsOpen/wsSend/wsReceived per i\ntest a più connessioni. Scenari: copione progressivo che riparte a ogni\nconnessione, regole (reply solo a chi ha parlato, json-subset cadenzato,\nniente eco di default), onEnd close con codice/reason fino al browser,\n426 sulla GET normale, push broadcast della console via admin API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R8GYUx4crbg9A1eYXv1asb\n\n* feat(client): micro app autocontenute per le prove manuali di ws e sse\n\nws-tester: connessione, transcript bidirezionale con timestamp, composer\ne macro (ping, subscribe). sse-tester: EventSource con listener per gli\neventi nominati, log con tipo/payload/lastEventId, stato della\nriconnessione automatica. Linkate da index.html e documentate nel README\n(tabella aggiornata anche con le suite ws-mock e sse-mock).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R8GYUx4crbg9A1eYXv1asb\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7eeb4f17121cba70fa44879ac9e917afedacef51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/trees/7eeb4f17121cba70fa44879ac9e917afedacef51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/commits/d4d39def8e833b1bb4f2f10f26db67b684e9f387","verification":{"payload":"tree 7eeb4f17121cba70fa44879ac9e917afedacef51\nparent f60495821096b5dd611076004bbf36553cf4d416\nauthor tosdan <3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com> 1784243036 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784243036 +0200\n\ntest: acceptance dei mock WebSocket + micro app di prova manuale ws/sse (#3)\n\n* test(fixtures): mock ws di workspace (copione, regole, close, console)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R8GYUx4crbg9A1eYXv1asb\n\n* test(ws): acceptance dei mock WebSocket dal browser\n\nHelper wsCollect (timestamp per la consegna progressiva, chiusura dal\nserver osservabile) e socket nominate wsOpen/wsSend/wsReceived per i\ntest a più connessioni. Scenari: copione progressivo che riparte a ogni\nconnessione, regole (reply solo a chi ha parlato, json-subset cadenzato,\nniente eco di default), onEnd close con codice/reason fino al browser,\n426 sulla GET normale, push broadcast della console via admin API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R8GYUx4crbg9A1eYXv1asb\n\n* feat(client): micro app autocontenute per le prove manuali di ws e sse\n\nws-tester: connessione, transcript bidirezionale con timestamp, composer\ne macro (ping, subscribe). sse-tester: E