isure: preflight-cache passa in un project dedicato\n(chromium-stack-mutating) che dipende dai tre project browser e quindi\nparte solo a suite finita, mai concorrente; e setToggleCors usa\n--no-deps, così compose non tocca nemmeno le istanze condivise.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd9ce0880f34506d57d3e0ddd99811d5cadfe41f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/trees/bd9ce0880f34506d57d3e0ddd99811d5cadfe41f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/commits/c69f608996ca5a2e75e109c8a08f53a42642dae1","verification":{"payload":"tree bd9ce0880f34506d57d3e0ddd99811d5cadfe41f\nparent 053c335a2e69d35b290ea8cf63539318a6b3b4d5\nauthor tosdan <3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com> 1784221740 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784221740 +0200\n\nfix(ci): isolate the container-recreating test from concurrent tests (#2)\n\nIn CI (2 worker) sequences.spec.js falliva con ECONNRESET sull''admin API\ndell''istanza principale: primo tentativo e retry cadevano entrambi nella\nfinestra in cui preflight-cache ricreava il container mockxy-toggle via\ndocker compose — la riconfigurazione di rete di Docker può resettare per\nun attimo le connessioni verso le altre istanze pubblicate.\n\nDue misure: preflight-cache passa in un project dedicato\n(chromium-stack-mutating) che dipende dai tre project browser e quindi\nparte solo a suite finita, mai concorrente; e setToggleCors usa\n--no-deps, così compose non tocca nemmeno le istanze condivise.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWRAsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj20QACXRtGWaIT1s4j5iZES9nK9S\neDi70ovBasgcSu3a6GdBjLIkQV6rVLLfKT4vB4I3g7QQGsjMB4gNj+1O+EfAihge\nteuhtVRIeifX6PyAZ0wCl92udYE5b6Ya9B4bK/gAmZ4Prz22H/rWsZYHzxiP9sLD\nTWu9Z7rfwYYLjIaMTfFYy8Rc2eZVIBVHFLzUGC9MW2uu4kkxtjRRvv9DCb1piNd0\nk4aqwxKAzhhNG65msjePYw/YhkXueblue7UtPs83KEN6v5IYI1UG