e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/commits/c69f608996ca5a2e75e109c8a08f53a42642dae1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3496697?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tosdan","id":3496697,"login":"tosdan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0OTY2OTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tosdan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/commits/053c335a2e69d35b290ea8cf63539318a6b3b4d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:54:48Z","email":"3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tosdan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T12:54:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: acceptance per sequenze di varianti, templating e mock SSE (#1)\n\n* test(workspace): fixtures for sequence, templating and sse endpoints\n\nNuovi endpoint nel workspace condiviso: /job-status (sequenza a due step),\n/greet/:id e /order-echo (mock templati da params/query/header/body),\n/sse-script (copione a tre eventi) e /sse-console (endpoint muto per la\nregia manuale via admin API).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: acceptance specs for sequences, templating and sse mocks\n\nTre pacchetti: la sequenza di varianti (step in ordine, stato terminale,\nreset e dettaglio via admin API — chromium-only e in serie: il cursore è\nstato runtime condiviso), il templating dei mock statici (params/query/\nheader/helper, filtri dei tipi, escape, body della richiesta, giro dal\nbrowser cross-origin) e i mock SSE (copione progressivo per connessione,\nripartenza a ogni connessione, push della console con broadcast verificato\nda un EventSource reale).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: named sse events, onEnd close reconnection, forMs/loop sequence\n\nCompleta i pacchetti sulle semantiche non ancora esercitate: eventi SSE\nnominati (nuovo helper sseCollectNamed nel client: onmessage non li vede,\nservono i listener per tipo; verificati data JSON/stringa e lastEventId),\nonEnd close con riconnessione automatica di EventSource secondo retryMs\n(il copione riparte sulla stessa EventSource), e la sequenza /phase con\ncriterio forMs dalla prima richiesta e onEnd loop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57814c6564ea7edb13767e667b5d28acf9d43d95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/trees/57814c6564ea7edb13767e667b5d28acf9d43d95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tosdan/mockxy-acceptance-tests/git/commits/053c335a2e69d35b290ea8cf63539318a6b3b4d5","verification":{"payload":"tree 57814c6564ea7edb13767e667b5d28acf9d43d95\nparent 87fcf636e4db9b5d6e1da6b0821390aa9ce57e8b\nauthor tosdan <3496697+tosdan@users.noreply.github.com> 1784206488 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784206488 +0200\n\ntest: acceptance per sequenze di varianti, templating e mock SSE (#1)\n\n* test(workspace): fixtures for sequence, templating and sse endpoints\n\nNuovi endpoint nel workspace condiviso: /job-status (sequenza a due step),\n/greet/:id e /order-echo (mock templati da params/query/header/body),\n/sse-script (copione a tre eventi) e /sse-console (endpoint muto per la\nregia manuale via admin API).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: acceptance specs for sequences, templating and sse mocks\n\nTre pacchetti: la sequenza di varianti (step in ordine, stato terminale,\nreset e dettaglio via admin API — chromium-only e in serie: il cursore è\nstato runtime condiviso), il templating dei mock statici (params/query/\nheader/helper, filtri dei tipi, escape, body della richiesta, giro dal\nbrowser cross-origin) e i mock SSE (copione progressivo per connessione,\nripartenza a ogni connessione, push della console con broadcast verificato\nda un EventSource reale).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test: named sse events, onEnd close reconnection, forMs/loop sequence\n\nCompleta i pacchetti sulle semantiche non ancora esercitate: eventi SSE\nnominati (nuovo helper sseCollectNamed nel client: onmessage non li vede,\nservono i listener per tipo; verificati data JSON/stringa e lastEventId),\nonEnd close con riconnessione automatica di EventSource secondo retryMs\n(il copione riparte sulla stessa EventSource), e la sequenza /phase con\ncriterio forMs dalla prima richiesta e onEnd loop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWNSYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYmoQAFMW3I/YaFzGGdYMK9pXxG/v\nqNnm2sYfeW4m/1Rwv/tqwTcoE93cgtshokmnyIb85VBV1RTlpsth67sU2uDIf44I\nXeV5CPFU+RriqUW5mwxDHB/3CojZu5kSAmpj9PCxJ9psdHSSsnjluq970y+YkyVK\njtCnfecCDi5xniRRg5r4aKODTSAtA/ltWkPlj59CYtyOdlajBfIjaUxQXaRuU5Gm\n6/ljnP1wcfilY1vKg+cBbc9h08/LasoWx8BfBqFjUCJyckvz3MFoUXSnUkN+A0qG\nNnvTMDnRPFoHAbhf44YY1TYaWeMd6MB/7vGosGsRaefEkfloJiiQKM4VzSXI7WlN\nZGguFhbGn8eape0GzTs+DdDhH3kr5gKUUdp1qWT6MTyYGSR85uViVomCI7mLKKTt\njfGq1BpCQy2xHV9Gq5rbfp+ttKEO74q869lafHaKiTpqGwgxE2op0gxTtHimFGgd\nQShYKoC6Hma+bXc2xWfV9Pghp3z4X8R1Jk5S5cqnlPNNI1A/Ao2ca9Ma1VcNBbc4\n+DsQ7lfuJGaQZGW4F1