"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/commits/ff47a0566ce9106fc90e90d84472a2ce87c4d513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:05:25Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:05:25Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"message":"fix(piano): max 评审修复——脚本加固、进 skill 目录、协议合规\n\nmax code-review（10 finder × 候选 dedup 29 条）修复：\n\ncorrectness：\n- review-package：BASE 拒收一切相对引用（~、^、@{——@~1/head~1/\n  main~1/HEAD@{1} 原全绕过）；输出改四反引号围栏（diff 内嵌 ```\n  不再提前闭合）；patch 超 3000 行降级为文件清单＋按需 diff 指引；\n  utf-8 编码＋解码失败走 exit 2 契约；git toplevel 锚定（子目录\n  调用不再误拒）；rev-parse 单调用取双 sha；merge-base 改\n  --is-ancestor；stat/patch 合并为单次 tree diff；确定性文件名\n  覆盖写（不再堆积过期副本）；写文件前自愈 .gitignore。\n- task-brief：围栏代码块内假标题不再误索引；Task 1.5 小数编号\n  不再误索引为 Task 1；重复任务号拒收并列行号；BOM 计划正常\n  提取、非 UTF-8 走 exit 2 契约；git toplevel 锚定（非 git 环境\n  退化为 plan 所在目录）；确定性文件名覆盖写；fail() 统一 raise。\n\ndeployment：\n- 两个脚本从 scripts/ 挪进 skills/playing-the-piano/scripts/ 并\n  镜像进 Codex 侧（原条款指示的路径在插件用户项目里不存在——\n  载荷只有 skills+hooks，GREEN 打样在本仓内跑掩盖了缺口）；\n  条款路径两端改写；test-dispatch-scripts 增两端一致性断言。\n\n协议合规（tests/README 明文）：\n- 4 份 piano-3/4 baselines 补全逐字全文（原标「全文」实为摘录）；\n- 借口对照表 7 条预置条目补 ★ 来源标注（superpowers 复盘移植，\n  待基线复核）；\n- tests/README 索引补 ab-test 报告；\n- piano-3-with-skill 的「铁律 7」引用修正为「第 7 条」。\n\nconsistency：\n- Codex 版「升档重派」悬空改写为宿主中立表述（换更强模型重派，\n  宿主支持指定时明令写出）——原文引用了从未定义的档位机制，\n  且「档位」在 Codex 侧被强度档位占据。\n- .single-spark git-ignored 断言改为动作式（脚本自愈 gitignore，\n  未补时别 commit）。\n\n测试基建：\n- git init 去 -b（git<2.28 兼容）；中文用例显式 utf-8；run() 加\n  timeout=60；ReviewPackageTest 改 setUpClass 共享仓库；fixture\n  处加注「新增 verify 步骤需同步 stub」；测试输出污染清理。\n\n22 例 dispatch 测试全过，make verify 全绿。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24ff8df0e37fd3e0f76c939bf92782bb338f37be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/trees/24ff8df0e37fd3e0f76c939bf92782bb338f37be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/commits/ff47a0566ce9106fc90e90d84472a2ce87c4d513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7228420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HXACA/single-spark/commit/ff47a0566ce9106fc90e90d84472a2ce87c4d513","node_id":"C_kwDOTUbjiNoAKGZmNDdhMDU2NmNlOTEwNmZjOTBlOTBkODQ0NzJhMmNlODdjNGQ1MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HXACA/single-spark/commit/f0800720fba5f47f9a2c8efb93b5634f767fc9d2","sha":"f0800720fba5f47f9a2c8efb93b5634f767fc9d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/si