e.py）。成对 transcript 入 baselines/。\n\n条款：playing-the-piano 两端点名两个脚本路径；.gitignore\n收 .single-spark/（派工 scratch）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd8a1ff0f01b4414885532b77c3971950c5edec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/trees/fd8a1ff0f01b4414885532b77c3971950c5edec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/commits/69f6fffd53efd003b15a4548ff14c7235e9617b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7228420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HXACA/single-spark/commit/69f6fffd53efd003b15a4548ff14c7235e9617b3","node_id":"C_kwDOTUbjiNoAKDY5ZjZmZmZkNTNlZmQwMDNiMTVhNDU0OGZmMTRjNzIzNWU5NjE3YjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HXACA/single-spark/commit/676dea115df5f4c345e7d396dee81db1a645b35c","sha":"676dea115df5f4c345e7d396dee81db1a645b35c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/commits/676dea115df5f4