n32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/commits/5253a3397b2789c3e370e4cae20091ca9edaf072/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:47:37Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T12:47:37Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"message":"feat!: 更名为 星星之火 (single-spark)，命令前缀与状态文件随插件名迁移\n\n为什么：项目正式命名为「星星之火」（三评委全票、经典度置顶权重下的\n冠军；官方英译 A Single Spark Can Start a Prairie Fire），slug 取前\n半句 single-spark 规避 prairie-fire 的政治史联想。「教员」保留为\npersona 名（agents jiaoyuan-*、meta skill following-jiaoyuan 不变）。\n\n改了什么（breaking）：skill namespace jiaoyuan:* → single-spark:*\n（58 处）；命令 /jiaoyuan:mode|review → /single-spark:mode|review；\n状态文件 .claude/jiaoyuan-level → .claude/single-spark-level；\nplugin.json/marketplace.json 更名并指向 github.com/HXACA/single-spark；\nREADME 以三档实测数据重写（''一个 skill 点燃弱模型''即名字出处）。\ntests/baselines 与历史报告作为测试记录不改。\n\n验证：tests/lint-skills.sh 全过；hook 冒烟——full 档注入 2814 字符\n且 namespace 全部切换（旧前缀零残留断言通过）、off 档静默。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68c2612ef0e683f512c6438b1aee5f1648bcb99b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/trees/68c2612ef0e683f512c6438b1aee5f1648bcb99b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/commits/5253a3397b2789c3e370e4cae20091ca9