rl":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/commits/7b6d0d0efe8b23849e41a1a1e207984aa4d0ed06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:40:48Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:40:48Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"message":"test: 补全 24 场景×三档全覆盖矩阵；确诊并修复三处跨档一致文本缺口\n\n为什么：9 个 *-2 场景此前未在任何档位跑过，fable 缺 builder AGENT 臂——\n覆盖矩阵不完整，无法区分文本缺口与模型容量问题。\n\n改了什么：9 个 *-2 场景 × 三档双臂 + fable builder 三臂/AGENT 补臂\n（66 被测+66 独立判定）；确立诊断规则「三档同缺=文本缺口，单档缺=\n模型容量」，据此修复三处：seizing-the-main-contradiction 补断一指\n关单标准（根因+回归测试计数）、on-protracted-war 补砍范围/安全网\n优先序与战略退却应答模板、jiaoyuan-builder 补请示不豁免收兵；产出\ntests/reports/2026-07-10-full-coverage-matrix.md。\n\n验证：三处修复分别在失守档复测——seizing-2@haiku resisted、\nprotracted-2@sonnet v4 resisted(4/4)、annihilation-2 AGENT@fable v2\nresisted(4/4)；本轮亮点数据 mushroom-2/bagu-2 在 haiku 上均\nviolated→resisted 整两级翻转（修正''反党八股增量最弱''的前轮结论）；\nfable 也在 investigation-2 RED 失守（partial），证明 skill 对最强档\n仍有增量；tests/lint-skills.sh 全过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29bfad31b32921b92585ea73d75fab6485b3b1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/git/t