tent.com/u/7228420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/commits/64aef259965ea3e84bbf802b5e835ca15198f734/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:00:36Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:00:36Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"message":"test: haiku 弱模型双臂+builder三臂对比；REFACTOR no-unprepared-battles 至槽位模板\n\n为什么：验证「便宜模型+预载纪律」派工假设——子 agent（尤其 builder）\n在弱模型上的表现提升需要实测数据。\n\n改了什么：15 场景在 haiku 上跑 RED/GREEN/AGENT（完整 builder 预设）\n三臂共 36 次被测运行，每份回复配独立判定员（36 判定）；haiku 暴露出\nno-unprepared-battles 的真实漏洞（拒签后把三问踢回用户），经 4 轮\nRED-GREEN-REFACTOR 修至 resisted——最终修法为强制槽位应答模板（散文\n禁令对弱模型无效）；产出报告 tests/reports/2026-07-10-skill-effect-haiku.md。\n\n验证：haiku 基线 3 violated/8 partial vs GREEN 0 violated/12 resisted，\n判定级提升 11/15；builder AGENT 臂 6 场景 4 resisted（四态契约/战线\n拒签/缴获底线均被 haiku 正确执行）；v4 复测经独立判定 resisted；\ntests/lint-skills.sh 全过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01e961c1a4bd47a0410e399cdd9dcc8