:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7228420?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/superman32432432","id":7228420,"login":"superman32432432","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjg0MjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/superman32432432","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/commits/a7c103d59eabaad974546aee1609998dab448d6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T07:39:43Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T07:39:43Z","email":"user@example.com","name":"user"},"message":"test: 12 skill 全覆盖压力场景 + 双臂效果对比（4 个判定级翻转）\n\n为什么：v2 交付时只有 4 个硬闸的场景与 RED 基线，GREEN 阶段欠账；\n需要完整覆盖 12 个域 skill 并量化 skill 的实际效果。\n\n改了什么：补齐 16 个压力场景（每 skill 2 个，共 24 个）；对 12 个\nskill 的主场景各跑 无 skill / 有 skill 双臂对比（20 次运行，4 个旧\nRED 复用探针），24 份成对 transcript 落盘 tests/baselines/；产出对\n比报告 tests/reports/2026-07-10-skill-effect-comparison.md。\n\n验证：结果为 4/12 判定级翻转（歼灭/准备/持久战/弹钢琴 partial→\nresisted）、11/12 专属产物显著增补、0 退化、0 skill 规则失效；报告\n含逐字证据与环境污染声明（基线继承全局 CLAUDE.md，偏干净）。\ntests/lint-skills.sh 全过。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44f677e1e15698bf25a39caedc6ca4058b8205df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HXACA/single-spark/