ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:06:40Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:06:40Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Dialog input reflects the configured tag-count maximum\n\nAdd a read-only POST action ''contentTagsConfig'' (CSRF-whitelisted, auth +\njcr:read_default, no mutation, no LLM call) returning {maxTags, defaultTags}\nfrom the service. The dialog fetches it when it opens and drives the number\ninput''s max, clamp, preset value and label (''Number of tags (max N)'') from\nit, falling back to 20/5 only if the fetch fails. Count label uses {{max}}\ninterpolation (EN+FR). Gate the fetch on isOpen.\n\nReviewed: jahia-cto-review -> approved, 0 critical / 0 blocking.","tree":{"sha":"0817c0172e6df5bcc3125a738cd2eca40a0999ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/trees/0817c0172e6df5bcc3125a738cd2eca40a0999ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/commits/7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0817c0172e6df5bcc3125a738cd2eca40a0999ec\nparent 22b3b1ac4a8e43bff6d9f484cb7c4f2cbb8461dc\nauthor Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1791385600 +0200\ncommitter Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1791385600 +0200\n\nDialog input reflects the configured tag-count maximum\n\nAdd a read-only POST action ''contentTagsConfig'' (CSRF-whitelisted, auth +\njcr:read_default, no mutation, no LLM call) returning {maxTags, defaultTags}\nfrom the service. The dialog fetches it when it opens and drives the number\ninput''s max, clamp, preset value and label (''Number of tags (max N)'') from\nit, falling back to 20/5 only if the fetch fails. Count label uses {{max}}\ninterpolation (EN+FR). Gate the fetch on isOpen.\n\nReviewed: jahia-cto-review -> approved, 0 critical / 0 blocking.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxzRFB70MBDXtpH9zHkA99FQ4YK\nsd17enK5qeADD0Q4UAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQE8H8hVaJXHMo7L0dGIOeqziJLvpS8ihktgNqBBBJvVrUMUfDdbKs0rDjouoRR/jA2\n5Ti0BeOeHtHMexMyaluAw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T15:07:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commit/7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e","node_id":"C_kwDOTUdEztoAKDdjMjcyNTNjN2NjZWU1ZDhiYTUzNjk4OTE1ZTJhNzRhYzNmMzkzMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commit/22b3b1ac4a8e43bff6d9f484cb7c4f2cbb8461dc","sha":"22b3b1ac4a8e43bff6d9f484cb7c4f2cbb8461dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/22b3b1ac4a8e43bff6d9f484cb7c4f2cbb8461dc"}],"sha":"7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/22b3b1ac4a8e43bff6d9f484cb7c4f2cbb8461dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:51:03Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:51:03Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Make the maximum tag count configurable via llm.tag.count.max\n\nThe ceiling was hardcoded at 20. Add llm.tag.count.max (default 20, hard-capped\nat 50): the requested count is clamped to it server-side, the configured default\nis clamped to it, and the response parser now caps at the effective count instead\nof a fixed 20. The dialog''s client sanity ceiling is raised to the absolute 50 so\nit never restricts below a raised server cap; the cfg value is the real governance.\n\nVerified live: cfg max=20 clamps a 35-request to 20; cfg max=30 passes a 25-request.\nDocs (README, CHANGELOG, store-listing) and shipped .cfg updated.","tree":{"sha":"9524e79f1658b1111827a22ed245a9b018d029d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/trees/9524e79f1658b1111827a22ed245a9b018d029d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/commits/22b3b1ac4a8e43bff6d9f484cb7c4f2cbb8461dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 9524e79f1658b1111827a22ed245a9b018d029d3\nparent 7b5ee93b4969b401bcfeefb0e3e9b66bc9c3f696\nauthor Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1791384663 +0200\ncommitter Stephane Monier <smonier@jahia.com> 1791384663 +0200\n\nMake the maximum tag count configurable via llm.tag.count.max\n\nThe ceiling was hardcoded at 20. Add llm.tag.count.max (default 20, hard-capped\nat 50): the requested count is clamped to it server-side, the configured default\nis clamped to it, and the response parser now caps at the effective count instead\nof a fixed 20. The dialog''s client sanity ceiling is raised to the absolute 50 so\nit never restricts below a raised server cap; the cfg value is the real governance.\n\nVerified live: cfg max=20 clamps a 35-request to 20; cfg max=30 passes a 25-request.\nDocs (README, CHANGELOG, store-listing) and shipped .cfg updated.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgxzRFB70MBDXtpH9zHkA99FQ4YK\nsd17enK5qeADD0Q4UAAA