,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/f8c6489363bce2a5abf2c87841e4af215b0a87cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:50:37Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:50:37Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Dialog renders in portal: use hardcoded Jahia hex, not theme vars\n\nThe dialog mounts through a portal into document.body, outside the\nMoonstone theme scope, so var(--spacing-*)/var(--color-*) resolved to\nnothing (no padding, invisible icon badge). Switch to hardcoded\nJahia-palette hex + px like page-audit/content-review. Replace Moonstone\nSeparator with a plain hairline div, shrink the icon and use Loader\nsize=small for a minimal inline spinner.","tree":{"sha":"be973f79b49f3fa28630f2418d9d66470eeecdd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/trees/be973f79b49f3fa28630f2418d9d66470eeecdd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/commits/f8c6489363bce2a5abf2c87841e4af215b0a87cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commit/f8c6489363bce2a5abf2c87841e4af215b0a87cb","node_id":"C_kwDOTUdEztoAKGY4YzY0ODkzNjNiY2UyYTVhYmYyYzg3ODQxZTRhZjIxNWIwYTg3Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commit/571ed8d224ef173a01213dd6dd45ae7e8b1542f1","sha":"571ed8d224ef173a01213dd6dd45ae7e8b1542f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/571ed8d224ef173a01213dd6dd45ae7e8b1542f1"}],"sha":"f8c6489363bce2a5abf2c87841e4af215b0a87cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/f8c6489363bce2a5abf2c87841e4af215b0a87cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/commits/571ed8d224ef173a01213dd6dd45ae7e8b1542f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:45:49Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:45:49Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Fix dialog layout: drop MUI DialogTitle/DialogActions, pin flex inline\n\nMUI v4 injects MuiDialogTitle-root/MuiDialogActions-root JSS after our\nstylesheet, overriding the module flex rules (icon stacked above title,\nbuttons stacked vertically). Replace those wrappers with plain divs and\nset the layout-critical flex (row/column, gap, align) as inline styles so\nnothing can override it. Loader is now a minimal inline spinner in the\nfooter that always shows while generating. Remove unused LoaderOverlay.","tree":{"sha":"8361a61ea0e0ef9f282812c48755041835c3dee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/trees/8361a61ea0e0ef9f282812c48755041835c3dee4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/automatic-content-tags/git/commits/571ed8d224ef173a01213dd6dd45ae7e8b1542f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_v