ttps://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/commits/7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:06:40Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:06:40Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"Dialog input reflects the configured tag-count maximum\n\nAdd a read-only POST action ''contentTagsConfig'' (CSRF-whitelisted, auth +\njcr:read_default, no mutation, no LLM call) returning {maxTags, defaultTags}\nfrom the service. The dialog fetches it when it opens and drives the number\ninput''s max, clamp, preset value and label (''Number of tags (max N)'') from\nit, falling back to 20/5 only if the fetch fails. Count label uses {{max}}\ninterpolation (EN+FR). Gate the fetch on isOpen.\n\nReviewed: jahia-cto-review -> approved, 0 critical / 0 blocking.","tree":{"sha":"0817c0172e6df5bcc3125a738cd2eca40a0999ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/git/trees/0817c0172e6df5bcc3125a738cd2eca40a0999ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/git/commits/7c27253c7ccee5d8ba53698915e2a74ac3f3932e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0817c0172e6df5bcc3125a738cd2eca40a0999ec\nparent 