r size=default) with a caption,\n  replacing the oversized full-height big loader\n- Stacked field label + wider language dropdown; footer hint left, actions right\n- Replace all hardcoded hex colors with Moonstone CSS variables\n  (--color-accent_light/accent_dark/text/gray_dark/warning/border, --spacing-*)\n- Add ''generating'' i18n caption (EN+FR)","tree":{"sha":"2d333f11250d025579e262ef6b9c6780f1b244e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/git/trees/2d333f11250d025579e262ef6b9c6780f1b244e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/git/commits/6829afe470943b8886ca15b2f99e1120afaadc0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smonier","id":722535,"login":"smonier","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjUzNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/commit/6829afe470943b8886ca15b2f99e1120afaadc0a","node_id":"C_kwDOTUgYE9oAKDY4MjlhZmU0NzA5NDNiODg4NmNhMTViMmY5OWUxMTIwYWZhYWRjMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/automatic-content-tags/commit/b92c60301395ece6229f8ad14edabce7225e2c3f","sha