ers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IntelKancharala","id":217931208,"login":"IntelKancharala","node_id":"U_kgDODP1dyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/commits/81389a71d2d518726ef82916eda1feb14409ad88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:44:53Z","email":"kancharla.intel@tatvacare.in","name":"IntelKancharala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:44:53Z","email":"kancharla.intel@tatvacare.in","name":"IntelKancharala"},"message":"fix: guard trackEvent, add MoEngage no-op, hide Form 3C checkbox in create-bill\n\nPort of the remaining ipd-dev follow-up. Cherry-picked clean.\n\ntrackEvent called window.Moengage.track_event without checking it exists, so any\ncontext where the SDK is absent crashed the page on the first tracked\ninteraction. trackMoEngageEvent right below it already guarded correctly; this\nmakes the two consistent.\n\nThis branch already skips the marketing SDKs in the receptionist iframe, which\nmeans without this it would suppress MoEngage and then crash on the ~300\nunguarded window.Moengage.* call sites. index.html now installs a no-op Moengage\nwhenever it skips the SDK, covering those without touching them.\n\nNeither problem is iframe-specific: patientViewBill also skips the SDK, and an\nad blocker breaking the MoEngage CDN produces the same crash on any route.\n\nThe create-bill drawer also still offered \"Add bill for Form 3C\", which the\nreceptionist iframe is not supposed to expose. Hidden alongside the other Form 3C\ntouch points.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee1f35e003474ac21b92e8c77006852bf0ba3223","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/trees/ee1f35e003474ac21b92e8c77006852bf0ba3223"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/commits/81389a71d2d518726ef82916eda1feb14409ad88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217931208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IntelKancharala","id":217931208,"login":"IntelKancharala","node_id":"U_kgDODP1dyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/commit/81389a71d2d518726ef82916eda1feb14409ad88","node_id":"C_kwDOTUkOFNoAKDgxMzg5YTcxZDJkNTE4NzI2ZWY4MjkxNmVkYTFmZWIxNDQwOWFkODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/commit/e7de93b4a9c586cb0c0be721a62ddbf624c2ecea","sha":"e7de93b4a9c586cb0c0be721a62ddbf624c2ecea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/commits/e7de93b4a9c586cb0c0be721a62ddbf624c2ecea"}],"sha":"81389a71d2d518726ef82916eda1feb14409ad88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/commits/81389a71d2d518726ef82916eda1feb14409ad88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217931208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IntelKancharala","id":217931208,"login":"IntelKancharala","node_id":"U_kgDODP1dyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/commits/e7de93b4a9c586cb0c0be721a62ddbf624c2ecea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:32:44Z","email":"kancharla.intel@tatvacare.in","name":"IntelKancharala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:32:44Z","email":"kancharla.intel@tatvacare.in","name":"IntelKancharala"},"message":"feat(ipd): drop Action heading, and stop marketing SDKs and 401 logouts in the iframe\n\nPort of the ipd-dev follow-ups.\n\n- With View Details hidden the Action column holds only the overflow menu, so the\n  heading is dropped and the column shrinks to the icon (48px).\n- public/index.html already computed isReceptionist and its comment claimed the\n  marketing SDKs were skipped for receptionists, but the condition never tested\n  it — MoEngage in-app campaigns were rendering over the IPD listing. MoEngage,\n  Clarity and GTM now check it, via a flag that also consults the sessionStorage\n  latch so a reload after in-app navigation still counts.\n- A 401 from any API cleared the auth token and bounced the receptionist to our\n  login screen inside Kea''s dashboard. There is no login to offer there, so in\n  iframe mode the 401 is surfaced to the caller and the token is left alone. The\n  two account-status effects that call handleLogout are guarded the same way.\n\nConflicts resolved against this branch''s shapes: no share-preview route in\nindex.html, and the interceptor here still reads error.response.status /\nerror?.request?.responseURL rather than the hoisted locals on ipd-dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7817ab6e4501d7a5a47bafd066d96f620653c269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/trees/7817ab6e4501d7a5a47bafd066d96f620653c269"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/commits/e7de93b4a9c586cb0c0be721a62ddbf624c2ecea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217931208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IntelKancharala/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IntelKancharala","id":217931208,"login":"IntelKancharala","node_id":"U_kgDODP1dyA","organizations_url":"h