 Respiratory,\n  IV Lines, Monitoring, Fluid Balance, Wound Care, Pain, Diet\n- Removed unrealistic fields: Obstetric Assessment, Baby Status, Surgical Site, Drain\n- MO note fields use actual form structure: Chief Complaint, Findings, Additional Remarks\n  (not SOAP format which is not in the actual MO progress notes form)\n- Removed free-text summary field from all nursing and MO notes (not a real form field)\n- Every patient now has at least 2 nursing + 2 MO progress notes (no empty MO states)\n- ADM-2026-003 (Ramesh Patel): added second nursing note and second MO note\n- ADM-2026-004 (Priya Nair): replaced empty MO array with 2 realistic MO notes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b275f5c0c1921fba22a4e10a8ff99b768d6dab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/trees/9b275f5c0c1921fba22a4e10a8ff99b768d6dab7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/commits/5f39e0bebb780371b2af6f2737009fbf3248697b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263944443?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyamgrdesign2-dot","id":263944443,"login":"shyamgrdesign2-dot","node_id":"U_kgDOD7t4-w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri