ONSULTANT_NOTES_IPD\n  with full clinical narratives per patient\n- Wire fetchDoctorTasks() and fetchProgressTimeline() demo mode branches\n- Fix demoBootstrap.js interceptor ordering: IPD-specific handlers\n  (progress-notes, consultant-notes, ot-notes, cross-referral, lab-results,\n  assessments) now precede broad /notes and /labs catches\n- Fix response shapes: IPD form thunks expect raw arrays, not wrapped objects\n- Add updates:[] and createdByName to consultant notes to prevent crash\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d812823aec9829a0b0466e2a3af55430c079803","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/trees/6d812823aec9829a0b0466e2a3af55430c079803"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Ipd/git/commits/cb1b1050fa05631ab53a50d013fa794c8fb31e92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263944443?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shyamgrdesign2-dot","id":263944443,"login":"shyamgrdesign2-dot","node_id":"U_kgDOD7t4-w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shyamgrdesign2-dot","user_view_type":"