}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranitap123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranitap123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/commits/49f3a89438ace785655c005d9864d2a62ae07db2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:46:45Z","email":"136261094+pranitap123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Pranita Panchal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T08:46:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":" RBAC + Envelope Encryption + 3D UI Redesign (#46)\n\n* feat(rbac): add authorize middleware and admin routes for cross-user file/user management\n\n* feat(audit): add ADMIN_* action types for role changes and cross-user operations\n\n* feat(auth): return role in login/register responses for client-side RBAC UI\n\n* fix(types): use string union for userRole instead of Prisma import to avoid module scope issues\n\n* feat(crypto): implement envelope encryption (AES-256-GCM) with per-file DEKs and master-key wrapping\n\n* feat(schema): add envelope-encryption columns (authTag, wrappedKey, keyIv, keyAuthTag, encVersion) to File model\n\n* feat(migration): create envelope_encryption migration - nullable columns for backward compatibility with legacy CBC files\n\n* feat(ops): add master-key rotation script for low-cost key management\n\n* chore(scripts): add rotate-key npm script\n\n* test(crypto): add 7 tests covering envelope encryption, tamper detection, and key rotation\n\n* fix(test): update vitest include glob to cover tests/ directory\n\n* refactor(config): rename ENCRYPTION_KEY to MASTER_KEY to reflect envelope-encryption design\n\n* fix(tsconfig): remove overly-broad ''types'' setting that was blocking express.d.ts global augmentation\n\n* feat(docker): add multi-stage backend Dockerfile with deps/build/production stages\n\n* feat(routes): mount /admin routes with authenticate + authorize RBAC gate\n\n* feat(files): refactor encryption to use envelope scheme; add version-aware decrypt path for legacy files\n\n* refactor(auth): move role lookup to DB on every request for fresh RBAC state\n\n* feat(seed): create demo accounts (admin + member) for RBAC testing and landing-page one-click login\n\n* feat(migration): add role enum and role column (default USER) to users table\n\n* feat(landing): add public homepage with 3D vault hero, feature grid, and one-click RBAC demo section\n\n* feat(routing): route / to landing page, catch-all to landing instead of /app\n\n* chore(meta): update page title to mention RBAC\n\n* feat(admin-ui): add 3D admin console (AccessCore, VaultSwitch, UsersPanel, FilesPanel) for RBAC demo\n\n* feat(nav): show Admin link only to ADMIN role, add role badge to header\n\n* style(theme): update color palette to vault theme (obsidian/brass/copper) — app-wide token refresh\n\n* style(globals): promote admin-zone tokens to :root, add card hover lift and shared keyframe animations\n\n* feat(components): add reusable Tilt component for mouse-tracked 3D depth on cards\n\n* feat(dashboard): add 3D VaultCore hero with live storage-percent ring fill and orbiting rings\n\n* feat(auth): add 3D VaultDoor hero for login/register pages with rotating bolts and center keyhole\n\n* style(buttons): add active:translate-y offset for 3D pressed effect on all button variants\n\n* feat(dashboard): integrate VaultCore hero and Tilt on stat cards\n\n* feat(files): add Tilt to grid-view file cards for consistent 3D treatment\n\n* feat(auth): integrate VaultDoor hero and query-param prefill for demo one-click login\n\n* chore(branding): update SecureVault references to CipherVault\n\n* feat(api): add admin client methods (listAllUsers, listAllFiles, updateUserRole, deleteAnyFile)\n\n* feat(types): add Role type and AdminUser/AdminFile interfaces\n\n* feat(docker-compose): add postgres/migrate/backend/frontend services with health checks and ordered startup\n\n* feat(docker-frontend): add nginx Dockerfile for static SPA serving with gzip and SPA rewrites\n\n* docs: document RBAC, envelope encryption, tamper detection, audit logging, rate limiting, and test coverage","tree":{"sha":"a30a8261329e1f5f45f2412e132fbd444597b4e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/git/trees/a30a8261329e1f5f45f2412e132fbd444597b4e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/git/commits/49f3a89438ace785655c005d9864d2a62ae07db2","verification":{"payload":"tree a30a8261329e1f5f45f2412e132fbd444597b4e4\nparent 66f71821a535d65af30e7472b03d646fb3c92875\nauthor Pranita Panchal <136261094+pranitap123@users.noreply.github.com> 1788511605 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788511605 +0530\n\n RBAC + Envelope Encryption + 3D UI Redesign (#46)\n\n* feat(rbac): add authorize middleware and admin routes for cross-user file/user management\n\n* feat(audit): add ADMIN_* action types for role changes and cross-user operations\n\n* feat(auth): return role in login/register responses for client-side RBAC UI\n\n* fix(types): use string union for userRole instead of Prisma import to avoid module scope issues\n\n* feat(crypto): implement envelope encryption (AES-256-GCM) with per-file DEKs and master-key wrapping\n\n* feat(schema): add envelope-encryption columns (authTag, wrappedKey, keyIv, keyAuthTag, encVersion) to File model\n\n* feat(migration): create envelope_encryption migration - nullable columns for backward compatibility with legacy CBC files\n\n* feat(ops): add master-key rotation script for low-cost key management\n\n* chore(scripts): add rotate-key npm script\n\n* test(crypto): add 7 tests covering envelope encryption, tamper detection, and key rotation\n\n* fix(test): update vitest include glob to cover tests/ directory\n\n* refactor(config): rename ENCRYPTION_KEY to MASTER_KEY to reflect envelope-encryption design\n\n* fix(tsconfig): remove overly-broad ''types'' setting that was blocking express.d.ts global augmentation\n\n* feat(doc