ckend file listing response\n- Verified Prisma persistence\n- Verified encrypted file storage\n- Verified audit logging\n- Added frontend integration documentation\n\nDeferred functionality, including password reset, email verification, refresh tokens, profile management, favorites, storage statistics, and automated testing, will be implemented in future milestones.\n\nThis merge completes the primary frontend/backend integration milestone for SecureVault.","tree":{"sha":"f1adf8e1d3c38ff40eb75c91b82c404af4833062","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/git/trees/f1adf8e1d3c38ff40eb75c91b82c404af4833062"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/git/commits/419e9246bb935b1752144200fc7b1ea4ca02fc49","verification":{"payload":"tree f1adf8e1d3c38ff40eb75c91b82c404af4833062\nparent b019e9a7975044719150bcefb7a800029d669abe\nparent 66f61ab3c9d8adbb6f2d1125bbb4bc4bae8ae5b2\nauthor Pranita Panchal <136261094+pranitap123@users.noreply.github.com> 1785583798 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785583798 +0530\n\nMerge pull request #44 from pranitap123/feat/frontend-integration\n\nMerge frontend integration into main.\n\nThis merge replaces the frontend mock API with the production Express backend.\n\nCompleted integrations include:\n\n- JWT authentication\n- Axios HTTP client\n- Request/response interceptors\n- User registration\n- User login\n- File upload\n- File listing\n- File download\n- File deletion\n\nThe backend and frontend now communicate directly through the production REST API using Axios.\n\nAdditional improvements:\n\n- Updated backend file listing response\n- Verified Prisma persistence\n- Verified encrypted file storage\n- Verified audit logging\n- Added frontend integration documentation\n\nDeferred functionality, including password reset, email verification, refresh tokens, profile management, favorites, storage statistics, and automated testing, will be implemented in future milestones.\n\nThis merge complete