isma migration\n- Establish User → AuditLog relationship\n- Create reusable AuditService\n- Add AuditAction enum for type-safe audit events\n- Refactor to use a shared Prisma client instance\n- Record successful user registration events\n- Record successful user login events\n- Record successful file upload events\n- Record successful file download events\n- Record successful file deletion events\n- Prevent audit logging failures from interrupting normal application flow\n- Add comprehensive implementation notes and documentation\n\nThis feature improves security, traceability, and maintainability by providing a centralized audit trail for important user actions while following a production-ready service-layer architecture.\n\nCloses #41","tree":{"sha":"e67ebb8dd1c6a1fd5674f6c605f0a470e01eaeec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/git/trees/e67ebb8dd1c6a1fd5674f6c605f0a470e01eaeec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranitap123/CipherVault/git/commits/20036cbebf27b0a4ecdfc17123b35ac5efc30521","verification":{"payload":"tree e67ebb8dd1c6a1fd5674f6c605f0a470e01eaeec\nparent 0817a61e37bd36f3387116bcc8c09d5486a13f4d\nparent 242ea5f872af7559864eca1c7e297062f1d3c86b\nauthor Pranita Panchal <136261094+pranitap123@users.noreply.github.com> 1785513531 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785513531 +0530\n\nMerge pull request #41 from pranitap123/feat/audit-logging\n\nImplement a complete audit logging system for SecureVault.\n\n- Add AuditLog model and Prisma migration\n- Establish User → AuditLog relationship\n- Create reusable AuditService\n- Add AuditAction enum for type-safe audit events\n- Refactor to use a shared Prisma client instance\n- Record successful user registration events\n- Record successful user login events\n- Record successful file upload events\n- Record successful file download events\n- Record successful file deletion events\n- Prevent audit logging failures from interrupting normal application flow\n- Add comprehensive